#: commands/cache-clear.md:9
msgid "Remove stored boundary data"
msgstr "Brisanje pohranjenih podataka o granicama"

#: commands/cache-clear.md:11
msgid ""
"Deletes the boundary data of one municipality, or of all of them, from your "
"computer. The tool downloads the data again the next time you ask for a "
"boundary."
msgstr ""
"Briše podatke o granicama jedne općine, ili svih općina, s vašeg računala. "
"Alat će podatke ponovno preuzeti kada sljedeći put zatražite granicu."

