#: commands/cache-info.md:9
msgid "See how much boundary data is stored"
msgstr "Koliko je podataka o granicama pohranjeno"

#: commands/cache-info.md:11
msgid ""
"Shows the folder where the tool keeps downloaded boundary data, the number of"
" municipalities and files, and the total size."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje mapu u kojoj alat čuva preuzete podatke o granicama, broj općina i "
"datoteka te ukupnu veličinu."

#: commands/cache-info.md:16
msgid ""
"Your computer is short of disk space and you want to know how much the tool "
"uses."
msgstr ""
"Računalu nedostaje prostora na disku i želite znati koliko ga alat zauzima."

#: commands/cache-info.md:17
msgid "You want to find the folder to back it up or to hand it to a colleague."
msgstr "Želite pronaći mapu da je sigurnosno kopirate ili predate kolegi."

#: commands/cache-info.md:21 commands/cache-list.md:22 commands/info.md:22
msgid "Nothing. This command takes no input and changes nothing."
msgstr "Ništa. Ova naredba ne traži unos i ništa ne mijenja."

#: commands/cache-info.md:26 commands/cache-list.md:27
#: commands/download-gis.md:29 commands/get-geometry.md:34
