#: commands/cache-info.md:50
msgid ""
"**Location** is the folder on your computer. **Total Size** is the disk space"
" used. The last two lines remind you of the commands that list and clear the "
"data."
msgstr ""
"**Lokacija** je mapa na vašem računalu. **Ukupna veličina** je zauzeti "
"prostor na disku. Zadnja dva retka podsjećaju na naredbe kojima se podaci "
"ispisuju i brišu."

#: commands/cache-info.md:56 commands/cache-list.md:53
msgid "None."
msgstr "Nema ih."

#: commands/cache-info.md:64
msgid ""
"This command has nothing to fail on. If the folder does not exist yet, the "
"tool says so; run a boundary lookup and it will be created."
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba nema na čemu zapeti. Ako mapa još ne postoji, alat to kaže; "
"pokrenite bilo koji dohvat granice i mapa će biti stvorena."

#: commands/cache-info.md:69
msgid "[cache-list](cache-list.md) lists the municipalities."
msgstr "[predmemorija popis](cache-list.md) ispisuje općine."

#: commands/cache-info.md:70 commands/cache-list.md:67
msgid "[cache-clear](cache-clear.md) removes stored data."
msgstr "[predmemorija obriši](cache-clear.md) briše pohranjene podatke."

#: commands/cache-list.md:9
msgid "See which municipalities are stored on your computer"
msgstr "Koje su općine pohranjene na vašem računalu"

#: commands/cache-list.md:11
msgid ""
"The boundary data of a municipality is downloaded once and then kept on your "
"computer. This command lists what is kept, how big it is and when it was last"
" updated."
msgstr ""
"Podaci o granicama općine preuzimaju se jednom i zatim čuvaju na vašem "
"računalu. Ova naredba ispisuje što se čuva, koliko je veliko i kada je zadnji"
" put ažurirano."

#: commands/cache-list.md:17
msgid ""
"You want to know whether the tool already has the data of a municipality "
"before you ask for a boundary."
msgstr ""
"Želite znati ima li alat već podatke neke općine prije nego zatražite "
"granicu."

#: commands/cache-list.md:18
msgid "You want to see how much disk space the stored data takes."
msgstr "Želite vidjeti koliko prostora na disku zauzimaju pohranjeni podaci."

#: commands/cache-list.md:47
msgid ""
"One row per municipality, with its number, the size of the data and the date "
"of the last download. The last lines give the total size and the folder where"
" the data lives."
msgstr ""
"Jedan redak po općini, s njezinom šifrom, veličinom podataka i datumom "
"zadnjeg preuzimanja. Zadnji reci daju ukupnu veličinu i mapu u kojoj se "
"podaci nalaze."

#: commands/cache-list.md:61
msgid ""
"If nothing has been downloaded yet, the tool says the store is empty and "
"suggests the download command. That is not an error."
msgstr ""
"Ako još ništa nije preuzeto, alat kaže da je spremište prazno i predlaže "
"naredbu za preuzimanje. To nije greška."

#: commands/cache-list.md:66
msgid "[cache-info](cache-info.md) gives the totals only."
msgstr "[predmemorija info](cache-info.md) daje samo ukupne vrijednosti."

#: commands/cache-list.md:68
msgid "[download-gis](download-gis.md) adds a municipality."
msgstr "[preuzmi-gis](download-gis.md) dodaje općinu."

#: commands/download-gis.md:9
msgid "Download the boundary data of a whole municipality"
msgstr "Preuzimanje podataka o granicama cijele općine"

#: commands/download-gis.md:11
msgid ""
"Fetches the file with the boundaries of every parcel in a cadastral "
"municipality and unpacks it into a folder of your choice, for use in a "
"mapping program."
msgstr ""
"Dohvaća datoteku s granicama svih čestica jedne katastarske općine i "
"raspakirava je u mapu po vašem izboru, za uporabu u kartografskom programu."

#: commands/download-gis.md:17
msgid ""
"A surveyor or an architect asks for the parcel boundaries of an area, not "
"just one parcel."
msgstr ""
"Geodet ili arhitekt traži granice čestica nekog područja, a ne samo jedne "
"čestice."

#: commands/download-gis.md:18
msgid ""
"You want to open a whole municipality in a mapping program such as QGIS."
msgstr ""
"Želite otvoriti cijelu općinu u kartografskom programu kao što je QGIS."

#: commands/download-gis.md:22
msgid ""
"You need the municipality, by name or number, and a folder name where the "
"files should go. The folder is created if it does not exist. The files are in"
" GML, a text form for geographic data that mapping programs read."
msgstr ""
"Trebate općinu, po nazivu ili šifri, i naziv mape u koju datoteke trebaju "
"otići. Mapa se stvara ako ne postoji. Datoteke su u obliku GML, tekstualnom "
"zapisu geografskih podataka koji kartografski programi čitaju."

#: commands/download-gis.md:52
msgid ""
"The tool reports the file it fetched, the folder it unpacked into, and the "
"number of parcels in the data. The folder now contains a file named "
"`katastarske_cestice.gml` with all parcel boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Alat javlja koju je datoteku dohvatio, u koju ju je mapu raspakirao i koliko "
"čestica sadrže podaci. Mapa sada sadrži datoteku `katastarske_cestice.gml` sa"
" svim granicama čestica."

#: commands/download-gis.md:58
msgid ""
"`--output` is required and names the folder. Add `--no-extract` to keep only "
"the downloaded ZIP file without unpacking it. Add `--clear-cache` to download"
" afresh even if the tool already has the data from an earlier run."
msgstr ""
"`--mapa` je obavezan i imenuje mapu. Dodajte `--bez-raspakiravanja` da "
"zadržite samo preuzetu ZIP datoteku bez raspakiravanja. Dodajte `--obriši-"
"predmemoriju` za novo preuzimanje čak i ako alat već ima podatke iz ranijeg "
"pokretanja."

#: commands/download-gis.md:73
msgid ""
"If you forget `--output`, the tool stops and tells you the option is missing:"
msgstr "Ako zaboravite `--mapa`, alat staje i kaže vam da opcija nedostaje:"

#: commands/download-gis.md:84
msgid "Add it with a folder name."
msgstr "Dodajte je s nazivom mape."

#: commands/download-gis.md:86
msgid ""
"If the download fails, the practice server may not be running. Ask the person"
" who installed the tool. Other messages are explained on the [errors "
"page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako preuzimanje ne uspije, probni poslužitelj možda nije pokrenut. Obratite "
"se osobi koja je instalirala alat. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o"
" greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/download-gis.md:92
msgid "[get-geometry](get-geometry.md) gives the boundary of one parcel."
msgstr "[granica](get-geometry.md) daje granicu jedne čestice."

#: commands/download-gis.md:93
msgid ""
"[cache-clear](cache-clear.md) removes downloaded data from your computer."
msgstr ""
"[predmemorija obriši](cache-clear.md) briše preuzete podatke s vašeg "
"računala."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:9
msgid "Get the boundary of a parcel for a map"
msgstr "Granica čestice za kartu"

#: commands/get-geometry.md:11
msgid ""
"Prints the corner points of a parcel in the official Croatian coordinate "
"system, so that a surveyor or a mapping program can draw it. It can also tell"
" you the area computed from those points."
msgstr ""
"Ispisuje lomne točke čestice u službenom hrvatskom koordinatnom sustavu, tako"
" da je geodet ili kartografski program može nacrtati. Može izračunati i "
"površinu iz tih točaka."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:17
msgid ""
"You want to hand the exact outline of a parcel to a surveyor or an architect."
msgstr "Želite geodetu ili arhitektu predati točan obris čestice."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:18
msgid ""
"You want to compare the area computed from the boundary with the area "
"recorded in the cadastre."
msgstr ""
"Želite usporediti površinu izračunatu iz granice s površinom upisanom u "
"katastru."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:19
msgid ""
"You want to place the parcel on a map in a program that understands "
"geographic data."
msgstr ""
"Želite smjestiti česticu na kartu u programu koji razumije geografske "
"podatke."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:23
msgid ""
"You need the parcel number and the cadastral municipality. The boundary data "
"for a whole municipality is downloaded once and kept on your computer; the "
"first lookup in a municipality therefore takes longer than the following "
"ones."
msgstr ""
"Trebate broj čestice i katastarsku općinu. Podaci o granicama cijele općine "
"preuzimaju se jednom i čuvaju na vašem računalu; prvi dohvat u nekoj općini "
"stoga traje dulje od sljedećih."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:27
msgid ""
"The coordinates are in the HTRS96/TM system (EPSG:3765), the official "
"projection for Croatia. They are not the degrees you see in a car navigation "
"system. A mapping program will know what to do with them."
msgstr ""
"Koordinate su u sustavu HTRS96/TM (EPSG:3765), službenoj projekciji za "
"Hrvatsku. To nisu stupnjevi kakve vidite u automobilskoj navigaciji. "
"Kartografski program znat će što s njima."

# fuzzy match of: **GEOMETRY STATISTICS** summarises the shape: the number of
# corner points (**Vertices**), the area computed from them (**Area (GIS)**),
# and the smallest rectangle that contains the parcel (**Bounding Box**). The
# last block is the boundary itself, written as a polygon in a standard text
# form. Each pair of numbers is one corner point.
#: commands/get-geometry.md:67
msgid ""
"**GEOMETRY STATISTICS** summarises the shape: the number of corner points "
"(**Vertices**), the area computed from them (**Area (GIS)**), the smallest "
"rectangle that contains the parcel (**Bounding Box**), and a link (**Map "
"URL**) that opens the official interactive map centred on the parcel. The "
"last block is the boundary itself, written as a polygon in a standard text "
"form. Each pair of numbers is one corner point."
msgstr ""
"**STATISTIKA GEOMETRIJE** sažima oblik: broj lomnih točaka (**Vrhovi**), "
"površinu izračunatu iz njih (**Površina (GIS)**), najmanji pravokutnik koji "
"obuhvaća česticu (**Granični okvir**) i poveznicu (**URL karte**) koja otvara"
" službenu interaktivnu kartu centriranu na česticu. Zadnji blok je sama "
"granica, zapisana kao poligon u standardnom tekstualnom obliku. Svaki par "
"brojeva jedna je lomna točka."

# fuzzy match of: `--format` chooses the form of the boundary. `wkt` is the
# standard text form shown above. `geojson` is the form most web maps read.
# `csv` gives one corner point per line for a spreadsheet. `json` gives the
# same data for other programs.
#: commands/get-geometry.md:76
msgid ""
"`--format` chooses the form of the boundary. `wkt` is the standard text form "
"shown above. `geojson` is the form most web maps read. `csv` gives one corner"
" point per line for a spreadsheet. `json` gives the same data for other "
"programs. The `geojson` and `json` forms also carry the map link (`map_url`)."
msgstr ""
"`--oblik` bira oblik granice. `wkt` je standardni tekstualni oblik prikazan "
"gore. `geojson` je oblik koji čita većina web karata. `csv` daje jednu lomnu "
"točku po retku za tablicu. `json` daje iste podatke za druge programe. Oblici"
" `geojson` i `json` sadrže i poveznicu na kartu (`map_url`; u obliku `json` "
"ključ je `url_karte`)."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:81
msgid ""
"To hand the boundary to someone, write it to a file with `--output`. A "
"GeoJSON file can be dragged onto many online map viewers:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste granicu nekome predali, zapišite je u datoteku pomoću `--datoteka`. "
"GeoJSON datoteku možete povući na mnoge mrežne preglednike karata:"

#: commands/get-geometry.md:100 commands/get-zoning.md:124
msgid ""
"If the parcel is not in the boundary data of the municipality, you will see "
"this:"
msgstr "Ako čestice nema u podacima o granicama općine, vidjet ćete ovo:"

#: commands/get-geometry.md:110 commands/get-zoning.md:134
msgid ""
"The boundary data and the cadastre are not always in step; check the parcel "
"with [search](search.md) first."
msgstr ""
"Podaci o granicama i katastar nisu uvijek usklađeni; prvo provjerite česticu "
"naredbom [pretraži](search.md)."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:113
msgid ""
"If the boundary data of the municipality cannot be downloaded, ask the person"
" who installed the tool whether the practice server is running. Other "
"messages are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako se podaci o granicama općine ne mogu preuzeti, pitajte osobu koja je "
"instalirala alat je li probni poslužitelj pokrenut. Ostale poruke objašnjene "
"su na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:119
msgid ""
"[download-gis](download-gis.md) downloads the boundary data of a whole "
"municipality."
msgstr ""
"[preuzmi-gis](download-gis.md) preuzima podatke o granicama cijele općine."

#: commands/get-geometry.md:120
msgid ""
"[cache-list](cache-list.md) shows which municipalities are already on your "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"[predmemorija popis](cache-list.md) pokazuje koje su općine već na vašem "
"računalu."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:9
msgid "Read the land registry unit: owners, parcels, encumbrances"
msgstr "Uvid u zemljišnoknjižni uložak: vlasnici, čestice, tereti"

# fuzzy match of: The land registry unit (zemljišnoknjižni uložak) is the
# legal
# record of a property. This command shows its three sheets: the parcels it
# covers (list A), the owners and their shares (list B), and the encumbrances
# such as mortgages and easements (list C). It also shows pending entries
# (plombe).
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:11
msgid ""
"The land registry unit (zemljišnoknjižni uložak) is the legal record of a "
"property. This command shows its three sheets: the parcels it covers "
"(posjedovnica, list A), the owners and their shares (vlastovnica, list B), "
"and the encumbrances such as mortgages and easements (teretovnica, list C). "
"It also shows pending entries (plombe)."
msgstr ""
"Zemljišnoknjižni uložak sadrži pravno stanje nekretnine. Ova naredba "
"prikazuje njegova tri lista: čestice koje obuhvaća (posjedovnica, list A), "
"vlasnike i njihove udjele (vlastovnica, list B) te terete poput hipoteka i "
"služnosti (teretovnica, list C). Prikazuje i plombe."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:19
msgid "You need to know who legally owns a parcel and in what shares."
msgstr "Trebate znati tko je pravni vlasnik čestice i u kojim udjelima."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:20
msgid ""
"You are checking for mortgages, easements, notes or other charges before a "
"sale or a loan."
msgstr ""
"Provjeravate hipoteke, služnosti, zabilježbe ili druge terete prije prodaje "
"ili kredita."

# fuzzy match of: You want to know whether a request is pending on the unit,
# for example an inheritance decision that has not been entered yet.
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:21
msgid ""
"You want to know whether a request for registration (prijedlog za upis) is "
"pending on the unit, for example an inheritance decision that has not been "
"entered yet."
msgstr ""
"Želite znati je li na ulošku u tijeku neki prijedlog za upis, na primjer "
"rješenje o nasljeđivanju koje još nije provedeno."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:25
msgid ""
"There are two ways to name the unit. If you start from a parcel, give the "
"parcel number and the cadastral municipality, and the tool finds the unit for"
" you. If you already have the unit number and the main book (glavna knjiga) "
"it belongs to, give those two instead."
msgstr ""
"Uložak možete odrediti na dva načina. Ako krećete od čestice, zadajte broj "
"čestice i katastarsku općinu, a alat sam pronalazi uložak. Ako već imate broj"
" uloška i glavnu knjigu kojoj pripada, zadajte to dvoje."

# fuzzy match of: The main book is identified by a number the tool calls the
# main book ID. You get it from the [batch-fetch](batch-fetch.md) results or
# from a previous lookup. Starting from the parcel is the easier route.
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:30
msgid ""
"The main book is identified by a number the tool calls the main book ID. You "
"get it from a [get-parcel](get-parcel.md) list result or from a previous "
"lookup. Starting from the parcel is the easier route."
msgstr ""
"Glavna knjiga određena je brojem koji alat naziva identifikatorom glavne "
"knjige (main book ID). Dobivate ga iz rezultata popisa čestica naredbe "
"[čestica](get-parcel.md) ili iz ranijeg dohvata. Kretanje od čestice lakši je"
" put."

# fuzzy match of: The first table, **LAND REGISTRY UNIT**, identifies the unit:
# its number, the main book, the office that keeps it, and **Last Diary
# Number**, the most recent file number entered in the diary (dnevnik).
# **PARCEL LIST (SHEET A)** is the posjedovnica, list A. **OWNERSHIP SHEET
# (LIST B)** is the vlastovnica, list B, with the share of each owner as a
# fraction. **ENCUMBRANCES SHEET (LIST C)** is the teretovnica, list C. When
# list C is empty, the tool prints **No encumbrances found**. When an entry is
# registered in favour of someone (its text ends with "u korist:"), the persons
# follow under **In favour of**, with their address and OIB when the registry
# has them.
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:84
msgid ""
"The first table, **LAND REGISTRY UNIT**, identifies the unit: its number, the"
" main book, the office that keeps it, and **Last Diary Number**, the most "
"recent file number entered in the diary (dnevnik); the row is empty when the "
"unit has no entry in the electronic diary. **PARCEL LIST (SHEET A)** is the "
"posjedovnica, list A. **OWNERSHIP SHEET (LIST B)** is the vlastovnica, list "
"B, with the share of each owner as a fraction. **ENCUMBRANCES SHEET (LIST "
"C)** is the teretovnica, list C. When list C is empty, the tool prints **No "
"encumbrances found**. When an entry is registered in favour of someone (its "
"text ends with \"u korist:\"), the persons follow under **In favour of**, "
"with their address and OIB when the registry has them."
msgstr ""
"Prva tablica, **ZEMLJIŠNOKNJIŽNI ULOŽAK**, određuje uložak: njegov broj, "
"glavnu knjigu, ured koji ga vodi i **Zadnji broj dnevnika**, najnoviji "
"poslovni broj upisan u dnevnik; redak je prazan kada uložak nema upisa u "
"elektroničkom dnevniku. **POSJEDOVNICA (LIST A)** je list A. **VLASTOVNICA "
"(LIST B)** je list B, s udjelom svakog vlasnika kao razlomkom. **TERETOVNICA "
"(LIST C)** je list C. Kada je list C prazan, alat ispisuje **Nema tereta**. "
"Kada je upis uknjižen u nečiju korist (tekst mu završava s \"u korist:\"), "
"osobe slijede pod **U korist**, s adresom i OIB-om kada ih zemljišna knjiga "
"ima."

# fuzzy match of: If the unit has pending entries, an extra line **Pending
# entries (plombe)** appears in the first table with the file numbers, and a
# warning follows. A plomba means a request has been received and the unit may
# be about to change. Do not treat the sheets as final until it is resolved.
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:95
msgid ""
"If the unit has pending entries, an extra line **Pending entries (plombe)** "
"appears in the first table with the file numbers, and a warning follows. A "
"plomba means a request for registration (prijedlog za upis) has been received"
" and the unit may be about to change. Do not treat the sheets as final until "
"it is resolved."
msgstr ""
"Ako uložak ima plombe, u prvoj tablici pojavljuje se dodatni redak **Plombe "
"(u tijeku)** s poslovnim brojevima, a slijedi upozorenje. Plomba znači da je "
"prijedlog za upis zaprimljen i da se uložak možda uskoro mijenja. Ne "
"smatrajte listove konačnima dok se on ne riješi."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:102
msgid ""
"`--all` shows the three sheets. To see only one, use `--show-owners` for list"
" B, `--show-parcels` for list A, or `--show-encumbrances` for list C. Without"
" any of them the tool prints the first table only."
msgstr ""
"`--sve` prikazuje sva tri lista. Da vidite samo jedan, upotrijebite "
"`--vlasnici` za list B, `--čestice` za list A ili `--tereti` za list C. Bez "
"ijednog od njih alat ispisuje samo prvu tablicu."

# fuzzy match of: To see what each pending entry is about, add `--plombe-
# detail`. The tool then asks the registry about every plomba, which takes one
# extra request each, and prints a table with the request type, its status and
# the date it was received:
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:106
msgid ""
"To see what each pending entry is about, add `--plombe-detail`. The tool then"
" asks the registry about every plomba, which takes one extra lookup each, and"
" prints a table with the type of the request for registration, its status and"
" the date it was received:"
msgstr ""
"Da vidite o čemu je svaka plomba, dodajte `--plombe`. Alat tada za svaku "
"plombu pita zemljišnu knjigu, što je jedan dodatni upit po plombi, i ispisuje"
" tablicu s vrstom prijedloga za upis, njegovim statusom i datumom zaprimanja:"

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:151
msgid ""
"To see at a glance whether anything registered against the unit stands in the"
" way of a sale, add `--blockers`. The tool reads the pending entries, list C,"
" the notes on the shares and the owners, names each finding by kind (a "
"mortgage, a dispute, an enforcement, a pre-emption right, a servitude, a "
"public body as co-owner) with the share or flat it applies to, and prints a "
"verdict: **No blockers**, **Conditional** or **Blocked**. Under the table it "
"lists the owners it flags as likely deceased, living abroad or a public body,"
" with the reason for each flag. Both are read from the register's text by a "
"fixed rule, which is printed under the table: treat them as a screening to "
"check against the sheets, not as a legal opinion. Add `--plombe-detail` as "
"well and each pending entry is named by the request it is."
msgstr ""
"Kako biste na prvi pogled vidjeli stoji li išta upisano na uložak na putu "
"prodaji, dodajte `--zapreke`. Alat čita plombe, list C, zabilježbe na "
"udjelima i vlasnike, svaki nalaz imenuje po vrsti (založno pravo, spor, "
"ovrha, pravo prvokupa, služnost, javno tijelo kao suvlasnik) s udjelom ili "
"posebnim dijelom na koji se odnosi i ispisuje ocjenu: **Bez zapreka**, "
"**Uvjetno** ili **Zapriječeno**. Ispod tablice navodi vlasnike koje označava "
"kao vjerojatno pokojne, s adresom u inozemstvu ili kao javno tijelo, s "
"razlogom svake oznake. Oboje se čita iz teksta zemljišne knjige prema fiksnom"
" pravilu koje se ispisuje ispod tablice: shvatite ih kao provjeru koju treba "
"usporediti s listovima, a ne kao pravno mišljenje. Dodajte i `--plombe` pa se"
" svaka plomba imenuje prijedlogom koji predstavlja."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:227
msgid ""
"The first table is the unit header as before. **Sale screening** gives the "
"verdict, and **SALE BLOCKERS** lists one row per finding: its **Kind**, its "
"**Severity** (blocking, conditional or informational), what it **Applies to**"
" (the whole unit, or one share or flat), the text of the entry and the amount"
" when there is one. A pending entry counts as blocking until it is decided. "
"**OWNER FLAGS (INFERRED)** lists only the owners with a flag and the "
"**Basis** of each one; an owner carried over from an earlier unit, or "
"registered decades ago, is flagged as likely deceased because such an entry "
"usually belongs to an estate, not because the register says so."
msgstr ""
"Prva je tablica zaglavlje uloška kao i prije. **Provjera zapreka prodaji** "
"daje ocjenu, a **ZAPREKE PRODAJI** navodi jedan redak po nalazu: stupac "
"**Vrsta**, stupac **Težina** (zapreka, uvjetno ili informativno), stupac "
"**Odnosi se na** (cijeli uložak, ili jedan udio ili posebni dio), tekst upisa"
" i iznos kada ga ima. Plomba se broji kao zapreka dok se o prijedlogu ne "
"odluči. **OZNAKE VLASNIKA (IZVEDENE)** navodi samo vlasnike s oznakom i "
"**Temelj** svake; vlasnik prenesen iz ranijeg uloška ili upisan prije više "
"desetljeća označava se kao vjerojatno pokojan jer takav upis obično pripada "
"ostavini, a ne zato što to zemljišna knjiga kaže."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:237
msgid ""
"To name the unit directly instead of starting from a parcel, use `--unit-"
"number` and `--main-book` together, as in the example above. If you know the "
"name of the main book (glavna knjiga, normally the cadastral municipality) "
"but not its number, give the name with `--main-book-name` and the tool looks "
"the number up for you:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste uložak zadali izravno umjesto od čestice, upotrijebite zajedno "
"`--unit-number` i `--main-book`, kao u gornjem primjeru. Ako znate naziv "
"glavne knjige (u pravilu naziv katastarske općine), ali ne i njezin broj, "
"zadajte naziv opcijom `--main-book-name` i alat će broj pronaći za vas:"

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:247
msgid ""
"The last column of the ownership sheet, **Entry**, tells you how each owner "
"got there: the order number of the registration entry (upis), the date the "
"request was received and its diary number (Z-broj). With `--all` the tool "
"also lists, under a share, the notes registered on that share alone, such as "
"a lifetime maintenance contract or a dispute."
msgstr ""
"Posljednji stupac vlastovnice, **Upis**, kaže kako je svaki vlasnik dospio u "
"uložak: redni broj upisa, datum zaprimanja prijedloga i njegov broj dnevnika "
"(Z-broj). Uz `--all` alat ispod udjela ispisuje i zabilježbe upisane samo na "
"tom udjelu, na primjer ugovor o doživotnom uzdržavanju ili spor."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:253
msgid ""
"To keep the result as a file, add `--format json` and `--output` with a file "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Da biste rezultat spremili kao datoteku, dodajte `--format json` i `--output`"
" s nazivom datoteke."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:256
msgid ""
"To read several units in one go, put them in a file and name it with "
"`--input`. The easiest file is the JSON that [get-parcel](get-parcel.md) "
"writes for a list of parcels with `--detail registry`: the tool takes the "
"unit of every parcel found and reads each unit once. You can also prepare a "
"CSV file with two columns, `lr_unit_number` and `main_book_id`, like the "
"example [lr_units.csv](../examples/lr_units.csv):"
msgstr ""
"Za uvid u više uložaka odjednom stavite ih u datoteku i navedite je uz "
"`--ulaz`. Najlakša je JSON datoteka koju naredba [čestica](get-parcel.md) "
"zapisuje za popis čestica uz `--detalji registry`: alat uzima uložak svake "
"pronađene čestice i svaki uložak čita jednom. Možete pripremiti i CSV "
"datoteku s dva stupca, `broj_zk_uloska` i `id_glavne_knjige`, poput primjera "
"[lr_units.csv](../examples/lr_units.csv):"

# fuzzy match of: Open Terminal in the folder where your file is.
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:272
msgid "Open Terminal in the folder where the file is and type:"
msgstr "Otvorite Terminal u mapi u kojoj je datoteka i upišite:"

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:339
msgid ""
"The units are printed one after another, separated by a line of dashes, each "
"laid out as above. The sheet choices apply to every unit. When one unit "
"cannot be read, the tool continues with the rest and lists the failures under"
" **ERRORS** at the end; add `--stop-on-error` to stop at the first problem "
"instead. For a long list, keep the result as a file with `--format json` and "
"`--output`."
msgstr ""
"Ulošci se ispisuju jedan za drugim, odvojeni crticama, svaki složen kao gore."
" Odabir listova vrijedi za svaki uložak. Kad se jedan uložak ne može "
"pročitati, alat nastavlja s ostalima i na kraju navodi neuspjele pod "
"**GREŠKE**; dodajte `--stani-kod-greške` da bi stao kod prvog problema. Za "
"dugačak popis spremite rezultat kao datoteku pomoću `--oblik json` i "
"`--datoteka`."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:368
msgid ""
"If you give a parcel but forget the municipality, the tool stops and asks for"
" it:"
msgstr "Ako zadate česticu, a zaboravite općinu, alat staje i traži je:"

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:376
msgid "Add `-m` and the municipality name or number."
msgstr "Dodajte `-ko` i naziv ili šifru općine."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:378
msgid ""
"If the unit number does not exist in that main book, the tool reports an "
"error that ends with `404 Not Found`. Check both numbers against your "
"document. Other messages are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako broj uloška ne postoji u toj glavnoj knjizi, alat javlja grešku koja "
"završava s `404 Not Found`. Provjerite oba broja na svom dokumentu. Ostale "
"poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:384
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows the cadastral side of the same parcel, "
"including the possessors."
msgstr ""
"[čestica](get-parcel.md) prikazuje katastarsku stranu iste čestice, "
"uključujući posjednike."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:385
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) with `--detail registry` lists the units of many "
"parcels, ready for `--input`."
msgstr ""
"[čestica](get-parcel.md) uz `--detalji registry` ispisuje uloške više "
"čestica, spremne za `--ulaz`."

#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:386
msgid "[Glossary](../glossary.md) explains list A, B and C and the plomba."
msgstr "[Pojmovnik](../glossary.md) objašnjava listove A, B i C te plombu."

# fuzzy match of: [get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows the possession sheet of a
# parcel with its possessors.
#: commands/get-lr-unit.md:387
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) with `--show-owners` shows the possessors, to "
"compare with the owners a blocker names."
msgstr ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) s `--posjednici` prikazuje posjednike, za "
"usporedbu s vlasnicima koje zapreka imenuje."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:9
msgid "See everything the cadastre holds about a parcel"
msgstr "Sve što katastar ima o čestici"

#: commands/get-parcel.md:11
msgid ""
"The full cadastral record of one parcel: location, area, land use, the "
"possession sheet (posjedovni list) with the people the cadastre records, and "
"the number of the land registry unit where the legal owners are."
msgstr ""
"Potpuni katastarski zapis jedne čestice: položaj, površina, način uporabe "
"zemljišta, posjedovni list s osobama koje katastar vodi i broj "
"zemljišnoknjižnog uloška u kojem su pravni vlasnici."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:17
msgid ""
"You are preparing a contract and need the area, the land use and the "
"cadastral state of the parcel in one place."
msgstr ""
"Pripremate ugovor i trebate površinu, način uporabe zemljišta i katastarsko "
"stanje čestice na jednom mjestu."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:18
msgid ""
"You want to compare who the cadastre records as possessor with who the land "
"registry records as owner."
msgstr ""
"Želite usporediti koga katastar vodi kao posjednika s onim koga zemljišna "
"knjiga vodi kao vlasnika."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:19
msgid ""
"You need the number of the land registry unit (zemljišnoknjižni uložak) of a "
"parcel so you can read its owners and encumbrances."
msgstr ""
"Trebate broj zemljišnoknjižnog uloška čestice da biste pročitali njegove "
"vlasnike i terete."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:20
msgid ""
"You have a list of parcels, from a contract or a spreadsheet, and want the "
"same record for each of them."
msgstr ""
"Imate popis čestica, iz ugovora ili iz tablice, i želite isti zapis za svaku "
"od njih."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:24
msgid ""
"You need the parcel number and the cadastral municipality, by name or number,"
" as for [search](search.md)."
msgstr ""
"Trebate broj čestice i katastarsku općinu, po nazivu ili šifri, kao za "
"[pretraži](search.md)."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:27
msgid ""
"Keep one distinction in mind while you read. The cadastre records possessors "
"(posjednici); the land registry records owners (vlasnici). They are often the"
" same people, but not always, and only the land registry is proof of "
"ownership. This page shows the cadastre. The [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) "
"page shows the land registry."
msgstr ""
"Dok čitate, imajte na umu jednu razliku. Katastar vodi posjednike; zemljišna "
"knjiga vodi vlasnike. Često su to iste osobe, ali ne uvijek, a samo je "
"zemljišna knjiga dokaz vlasništva. Ova stranica prikazuje katastar. Stranica "
"[uložak](get-lr-unit.md) prikazuje zemljišnu knjigu."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:89
msgid ""
"The screen has five parts. **PARCEL INFORMATION** identifies the parcel; the "
"line **Cadastre/LR harmonized** says whether the cadastre and the land "
"registry agree about it. **LAND USE** splits the area by cadastral culture. "
"**POSSESSION SHEET (cadastre / posjedovni list)** lists the possessors the "
"cadastre records, with their share where the cadastre has one. **LAND "
"REGISTRY** gives the number of the land registry unit (**Unit Number**) that "
"you can look up next. **ADDITIONAL INFO** contains a link that opens the "
"parcel on the public map."
msgstr ""
"Zaslon ima pet dijelova. **INFORMACIJE O ČESTICI** određuje česticu; redak "
"**Katastar/ZK usklađeni** kaže slažu li se katastar i zemljišna knjiga o "
"njoj. **NAČIN UPORABE** dijeli površinu po katastarskoj kulturi. **POSJEDOVNI"
" LIST (katastar)** ispisuje posjednike koje katastar vodi, s udjelom gdje ga "
"katastar ima. **ZEMLJIŠNA KNJIGA** daje broj zemljišnoknjižnog uloška (**Broj"
" uloška**) koji zatim možete potražiti. **DODATNE INFORMACIJE** sadrži "
"poveznicu koja otvara česticu na javnoj karti."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:98
msgid ""
"Where a value is not recorded, the tool prints **N/A**. In the possession "
"sheet this is common: the cadastre often records who possesses without "
"recording a share."
msgstr ""
"Gdje vrijednost nije upisana, alat ispisuje **N/D**. U posjedovnom listu to "
"je često: katastar nerijetko vodi tko posjeduje, a ne vodi udio."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:104
msgid ""
"Without `--show-owners` the possession sheet is left out and the screen is "
"shorter. Add it whenever you want to see the people."
msgstr ""
"Bez `--posjednici` posjedovni list se izostavlja i zaslon je kraći. Dodajte "
"ga kad god želite vidjeti osobe."

# fuzzy match of: `--detail` narrows the screen to one part: `basic` for the
# identification only, `owners` for the possession sheet, `landuse` for the
# land use split, `geometry` for the boundary coordinates, `full` for
# everything.
#: commands/get-parcel.md:107
msgid ""
"`--detail` narrows the screen to one part: `basic` for the identification "
"only, `owners` for the possession sheet, `landuse` for the land use split, "
"`geometry` for the boundary coordinates, `registry` for the land registry "
"unit, `full` for everything."
msgstr ""
"`--detalji` sužava zaslon na jedan dio: `basic` samo za identifikaciju, "
"`owners` za posjedovni list, `landuse` za podjelu po načinu uporabe, "
"`geometry` za koordinate granice, `registry` za zemljišnoknjižni uložak, "
"`full` za sve."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:112
msgid ""
"A building parcel (čestica zgrade) is written on documents as `35/1 ZGR`, "
"`35/1.ZGR` or `zgr. 35/1`. Type it in any of these forms; the tool shows it "
"as `zgr. 35/1` and marks it as a building parcel. Building parcels have no "
"land registry unit of their own, because the building is registered on its "
"land parcel."
msgstr ""
"Čestica zgrade na dokumentima se piše kao `35/1 ZGR`, `35/1.ZGR` ili `zgr. "
"35/1`. Upišite je u bilo kojem od tih oblika; alat je prikazuje kao `zgr. "
"35/1` i označuje kao česticu zgrade. Čestice zgrade nemaju vlastiti "
"zemljišnoknjižni uložak, jer je zgrada upisana na svojoj zemljišnoj čestici."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:126
msgid ""
"To keep the record as a file, add `--format json` and `--output` with a file "
"name. This is the form to use when you want to attach the data to a case file"
" or pass it to a colleague."
msgstr ""
"Da zapis spremite u datoteku, dodajte `--oblik json` i `--datoteka` s nazivom"
" datoteke. Taj oblik koristite kad podatke želite priložiti spisu ili "
"proslijediti kolegi."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:134
msgid ""
"To look up several parcels in one go, type their numbers separated by commas,"
" inside quotes. Add `--detail registry` to get one row per parcel with its "
"area, its parcel ID and the land registry unit it belongs to:"
msgstr ""
"Za pretragu više čestica odjednom upišite njihove brojeve odvojene zarezima, "
"unutar navodnika. Dodajte `--detalji registry` da dobijete jedan redak po "
"čestici s njezinom površinom, ID-om čestice i zemljišnoknjižnim uloškom kojem"
" pripada:"

#: commands/get-parcel.md:158
msgid ""
"Each row of **RESULTS** is one parcel. **Status** shows a tick for found and "
"a cross for not found. **LR Unit** and **Main Book** identify the land "
"registry unit of the parcel, which is what [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) "
"needs next. Without `--detail registry` the full record of every parcel is "
"printed, one after another."
msgstr ""
"Svaki redak tablice **REZULTATI** jedna je čestica. **Status** pokazuje "
"kvačicu za pronađenu i križić za nepronađenu česticu. **ZK uložak** i "
"**Glavna knjiga** označavaju zemljišnoknjižni uložak čestice, a to je ono što"
" naredbi [uložak](get-lr-unit.md) treba u sljedećem koraku. Bez `--detalji "
"registry` ispisuje se potpuni zapis svake čestice, jedan za drugim."

# fuzzy match of: For a handful of parcels in one municipality, you type them
# on the line, separated by commas. For longer lists, prepare a file. The
# simplest file is a CSV, which you can save from any spreadsheet program. It
# has two columns, `parcel_number` and `municipality`, and looks like this:
#: commands/get-parcel.md:164
msgid ""
"For a longer list, prepare a file instead. The simplest file is a CSV, which "
"you can save from any spreadsheet program. It has two columns, "
"`parcel_number` and `municipality`, and looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"Za dulji popis pripremite datoteku. Najjednostavnija je CSV datoteka, koju "
"možete spremiti iz bilo kojeg programa za tablice. Ima dva stupca, "
"`broj_cestice` i `opcina`, i izgleda ovako:"

# fuzzy match of: An empty municipality cell means "same as the row above". A
# JSON file with the same content is accepted too. Example files:
# [parcels.csv](../examples/parcels.csv),
# [parcels.json](../examples/parcels.json).
#: commands/get-parcel.md:177
msgid ""
"An empty municipality cell means \"same as the row above\". A JSON file with "
"the same content is accepted too. Example files: "
"[parcels.csv](../examples/parcels.csv), "
"[parcels.json](../examples/parcels.json). Open Terminal in the folder where "
"the file is and name it with `--input`:"
msgstr ""
"Prazno polje općine znači „isto kao u retku iznad”. Prihvaća se i JSON "
"datoteka istog sadržaja. Primjeri datoteka: "
"[parcels.csv](../examples/parcels.csv), "
"[parcels.json](../examples/parcels.json). Otvorite Terminal u mapi u kojoj je"
" datoteka i navedite je uz `--ulaz`:"

# fuzzy match of: To go on to the land registry, keep the result as a JSON
# file
# with `--format json` and `--output`. The [batch-lr-unit](batch-lr-unit.md)
# page can read that file directly:
#: commands/get-parcel.md:186
msgid ""
"To go on to the land registry, keep the result as a JSON file with `--format "
"json` and `--output`. The [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) page can read that "
"file directly:"
msgstr ""
"Za nastavak prema zemljišnoj knjizi spremite rezultat kao JSON datoteku "
"pomoću `--oblik json` i `--datoteka`. Stranica [uložak](get-lr-unit.md) tu "
"datoteku može izravno pročitati:"

#: commands/get-parcel.md:195
msgid ""
"The field names in a JSON or CSV file follow the language of the tool, so a "
"colleague who runs it in the other language gets the names of that language. "
"The tool reads files back in either language."
msgstr ""
"Nazivi polja u JSON ili CSV datoteci slijede jezik alata, pa kolega koji ga "
"pokreće na drugom jeziku dobiva nazive tog jezika. Alat datoteke čita natrag "
"na oba jezika."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:215
msgid "If the municipality is not recognised, the tool says so and stops:"
msgstr "Ako općina nije prepoznata, alat to kaže i staje:"

#: commands/get-parcel.md:228
msgid ""
"Check the spelling, or use the registration number instead of the name. You "
"can find it with [search-municipality](search-municipality.md)."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite pravopis ili umjesto naziva upotrijebite šifru. Možete je pronaći "
"naredbom [traži-općinu](search-municipality.md)."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:231
msgid ""
"If the parcel is not found, check the number on your document, including any "
"part after the slash. Other messages are explained on the [errors "
"page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako čestica nije pronađena, provjerite broj na svom dokumentu, uključujući "
"dio iza kose crte. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o "
"greškama](../errors.md)."

# fuzzy match of: A parcel that does not exist does not stop the run. It gets
# a
# cross in the **Status** column and an explanation in an **ERRORS** table at
# the end:
#: commands/get-parcel.md:235
msgid ""
"A parcel that does not exist does not stop a list. It gets a cross in the "
"**Status** column and an explanation in an **ERRORS** table at the end:"
msgstr ""
"Čestica koja ne postoji ne prekida popis. Dobiva križić u stupcu **Status** i"
" objašnjenje u tablici **GREŠKE** na kraju:"

#: commands/get-parcel.md:260
msgid ""
"Correct the number and run the command again for that parcel alone. If you "
"would rather stop at the first problem, add `--stop-on-error`. If the tool "
"cannot find the file you named with `--input`, check that Terminal is in the "
"folder where the file is, or type the full path to it."
msgstr ""
"Ispravite broj i ponovno pokrenite naredbu samo za tu česticu. Ako radije "
"želite stati kod prvog problema, dodajte `--stani-kod-greške`. Ako alat ne "
"može pronaći datoteku koju ste naveli uz `--ulaz`, provjerite je li Terminal "
"u mapi u kojoj je datoteka, ili upišite njezinu punu putanju."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:267
msgid ""
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) reads the land registry unit whose number "
"appears under the land registry heading."
msgstr ""
"[uložak](get-lr-unit.md) čita zemljišnoknjižni uložak čiji se broj pojavljuje"
" pod naslovom zemljišne knjige."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:268
msgid "[search](search.md) is the short form of this command."
msgstr "[pretraži](search.md) je kraći oblik ove naredbe."

#: commands/get-parcel.md:269
msgid ""
"[get-geometry](get-geometry.md) gives the boundary of the parcel for a map."
msgstr "[granica](get-geometry.md) daje granicu čestice za kartu."

# fuzzy match of: Find a possession sheet by its number
#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:9
msgid "See a possession sheet with its parcels"
msgstr "Pogledajte posjedovni list s njegovim česticama"

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:11
msgid ""
"A possession sheet (posjedovni list) is the cadastre's record of who "
"possesses a group of parcels. This command shows the whole sheet: every "
"parcel on it, with its area, land use and land registry unit, and, when you "
"ask for them, the possessors recorded on the sheet."
msgstr ""
"Posjedovni list je katastarski zapis o tome tko posjeduje skupinu čestica. "
"Ova naredba prikazuje cijeli list: svaku česticu na njemu, s površinom, "
"načinom uporabe i zemljišnoknjižnim uloškom, a na zahtjev i posjednike "
"upisane na listu."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:18
msgid ""
"An inheritance names a possession sheet, and you want the list of parcels on "
"it before you look up each one in the land registry."
msgstr ""
"Ostavinsko rješenje navodi posjedovni list, a vi želite popis čestica na "
"njemu prije nego što svaku potražite u zemljišnoj knjizi."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:20
msgid ""
"A client says \"our land is on posjedovni list 363\" and you want to see how "
"much land that is and who the cadastre records as possessing it."
msgstr ""
"Klijent kaže „naša je zemlja na posjedovnom listu 363\", a vi želite vidjeti "
"koliko je to zemlje i koga katastar bilježi kao posjednika."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:22
msgid ""
"You want to check whether a parcel someone mentions is on the same sheet as "
"the others."
msgstr ""
"Želite provjeriti je li čestica koju netko spominje na istom listu kao i "
"ostale."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:27
msgid ""
"You need the exact possession sheet number and the cadastral municipality "
"(katastarska općina), both printed on the extract from the possession sheet "
"and on most inheritance decisions. If you only know the start of the number, "
"[search-possession-sheet](search-possession-sheet.md) lists the sheets that "
"begin with it."
msgstr ""
"Trebate točan broj posjedovnog lista i katastarsku općinu; oboje je otisnuto "
"na izvatku iz posjedovnog lista i na većini ostavinskih rješenja. Ako znate "
"samo početak broja, [search-possession-sheet](search-possession-sheet.md) "
"nabraja listove koji njime počinju."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:71
msgid ""
"The first block names the sheet and counts what is on it. **Total area** adds"
" up the cadastre areas of the parcels. The **PARCELS** table lists every "
"parcel: **Land Use** is the cadastre's classification with the area of each "
"kind, **Cadastre/LR harmonized** says whether the cadastre and the land "
"registry agree about the parcel, and **LR Unit** gives the land registry unit"
" and main book you pass to [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) for the registered "
"owners."
msgstr ""
"Prvi blok imenuje list i broji što je na njemu. **Ukupna površina** zbraja "
"katastarske površine čestica. Tablica **ČESTICE** nabraja svaku česticu: "
"**Način uporabe** je katastarska klasifikacija s površinom svake vrste, "
"**Katastar/ZK usklađeni** kaže slažu li se katastar i zemljišna knjiga o "
"čestici, a **ZK uložak** daje zemljišnoknjižni uložak i glavnu knjigu koje "
"predajete naredbi [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) za upisane vlasnike."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:81
msgid ""
"Add `--show-owners` to see the possessors recorded on the sheet, with their "
"shares and addresses. They are possessors according to the cadastre, not the "
"registered owners; the registered owners are in the land registry unit named "
"in the **LR Unit** column, and the last line of the output shows the command "
"that reads it."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--show-owners` da vidite posjednike upisane na listu, s udjelima i "
"adresama. To su posjednici prema katastru, ne upisani vlasnici; upisani "
"vlasnici su u zemljišnoknjižnom ulošku iz stupca **ZK uložak**, a posljednji "
"redak ispisa pokazuje naredbu koja ga čita."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:87
msgid ""
"Some sheets are harmonized with the land registry: for them the cadastre "
"records no possessors of its own and refers to the land registry unit "
"instead. The tool then says **in the land registry (harmonized sheet)** on "
"the **Possessors** line and, with `--show-owners`, lists the registered "
"owners of that unit under **REGISTERED OWNERS (LAND REGISTRY)**; in JSON "
"`possessors_in_land_registry` is `true` and the people are under `owners`."
msgstr ""
"Neki su listovi usklađeni sa zemljišnom knjigom: za njih katastar ne bilježi "
"vlastite posjednike, nego upućuje na zemljišnoknjižni uložak. Alat tada u "
"retku **Posjednici** ispisuje **u zemljišnoj knjizi (usklađeni list)**, a uz "
"`--show-owners` nabraja upisane vlasnike tog uloška pod **UPISANI VLASNICI "
"(ZEMLJIŠNA KNJIGA)**; u JSON-u je `posjednici_u_zemljisnoj_knjizi` `true`, a "
"osobe su pod `vlasnici`."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:94
msgid ""
"`--format json` writes the sheet as one document, with `parcels`, "
"`total_parcels`, `total_area_m2` and `parcels_complete`; `--format csv` "
"writes one row per parcel. Both go to a file with `--output`."
msgstr ""
"`--format json` zapisuje list kao jedan dokument, s `cestice`, "
"`broj_cestica`, `ukupna_povrsina_m2` i `popis_cestica_potpun`; `--format csv`"
" zapisuje jedan redak po čestici. Oboje ide u datoteku uz `--output`."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:98
msgid ""
"The cadastre's parcel search has never been seen to return more than 30 "
"parcels for one sheet. When a sheet comes back with exactly that many, the "
"tool warns that the list may be incomplete and `parcels_complete` is `false`;"
" check the extract from the possession sheet in that case."
msgstr ""
"Katastarsko pretraživanje čestica nikad nije vratilo više od 30 čestica za "
"jedan list. Kad se list vrati s točno toliko čestica, alat upozorava da popis"
" možda nije potpun, a `popis_cestica_potpun` je `false`; u tom slučaju "
"provjerite izvadak iz posjedovnog lista."

# fuzzy match of: If no sheet starts with the number you typed, the tool stops
# with this line:
#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:115
msgid ""
"If there is no sheet with that exact number in the cadastral municipality, "
"the tool stops with this line:"
msgstr ""
"Ako u katastarskoj općini nema lista s tim točnim brojem, alat staje s ovim "
"retkom:"

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:124
msgid ""
"Check the number on your document; the number must be complete, so try "
"[search-possession-sheet](search-possession-sheet.md) if you only know how it"
" starts. Other messages are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite broj na svom dokumentu; broj mora biti potpun, pa pokušajte "
"[search-possession-sheet](search-possession-sheet.md) ako znate samo kako "
"počinje. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md)."

# fuzzy match of: [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) reads a land registry unit.
#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:130
msgid ""
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) shows the registered owners and the charges of "
"the land registry unit a parcel belongs to."
msgstr ""
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) prikazuje upisane vlasnike i terete "
"zemljišnoknjižnog uloška kojem čestica pripada."

# fuzzy match of: [get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows the cadastral side of the
# same parcel, including the possessors.
#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:131
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows one parcel in full, with its possession "
"sheet."
msgstr ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) prikazuje jednu česticu u cijelosti, s njezinim "
"posjedovnim listom."

#: commands/get-possession-sheet.md:132
msgid ""
"[search-possession-sheet](search-possession-sheet.md) finds the sheets whose "
"number starts with a text."
msgstr ""
"[search-possession-sheet](search-possession-sheet.md) pronalazi listove čiji "
"broj počinje zadanim tekstom."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:9
msgid "Find out whether a parcel is in a building area"
msgstr "Saznajte je li čestica u građevinskom području"

#: commands/get-zoning.md:11
msgid ""
"Tells you where a parcel lies with respect to the building areas of the "
"spatial plans: inside the building area of a settlement, in a separate zone "
"outside a settlement (a tourist settlement, a camp, an industrial zone), or "
"outside every building area. It names the zone, its designation code and the "
"plan it comes from. It does not tell you whether anything may be built there."
msgstr ""
"Kaže vam gdje čestica leži u odnosu na građevinska područja prostornih "
"planova: unutar građevinskog područja naselja, u izdvojenom području izvan "
"naselja (turističko naselje, kamp, gospodarska zona) ili izvan svih "
"građevinskih područja. Navodi zonu, njezinu oznaku namjene i plan iz kojega "
"potječe. Ne govori vam smije li se ondje što graditi."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:19
msgid ""
"A client is about to buy a parcel and you want a first check of whether it "
"lies in a building area at all, before reading the plan."
msgstr ""
"Stranka namjerava kupiti česticu i želite prvu provjeru leži li uopće u "
"građevinskom području, prije čitanja plana."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:20
msgid ""
"You want to know whether a parcel is in a tourist zone before a valuation."
msgstr ""
"Želite znati je li čestica u turističkoj zoni prije procjene vrijednosti."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:21
msgid ""
"You are checking which spatial plan applies to a parcel before asking the "
"municipality for a lokacijska informacija."
msgstr ""
"Provjeravate koji se prostorni plan odnosi na česticu prije nego što od "
"općine zatražite lokacijsku informaciju."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:26
msgid ""
"You need the parcel number and the cadastral municipality, as for [get-"
"geometry](get-geometry.md). The boundary data of the municipality is "
"downloaded once and kept on your computer."
msgstr ""
"Trebate broj čestice i katastarsku općinu, kao i za [granica](get-"
"geometry.md). Podaci o granicama općine preuzimaju se jednom i čuvaju na "
"vašem računalu."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:30
msgid ""
"The answer comes from the building areas (građevinska područja) that the "
"county spatial-planning institutes drew from the plans in force. It is an "
"interpretation of the plans, not the plans themselves: the tool says so at "
"the end of every answer, and an official answer still needs the plan or a "
"lokacijska informacija from the municipality."
msgstr ""
"Odgovor dolazi iz građevinskih područja koja su županijski zavodi za "
"prostorno uređenje iscrtali iz važećih planova. To je interpretacija planova,"
" a ne sami planovi: alat to kaže na kraju svakog odgovora, a za službeni "
"odgovor i dalje trebate plan ili lokacijsku informaciju općine."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:36
msgid ""
"Being inside a building area is not permission to build. The plan's "
"provisions, the size of the plot, access, utilities, protected areas and the "
"need for a more detailed plan are not checked by this tool, so the "
"**Buildability** line always says it was not determined."
msgstr ""
"Položaj unutar građevinskog područja nije dozvola za gradnju. Odredbe plana, "
"veličinu građevne čestice, pristup, komunalnu opremu, zaštićena područja i "
"obvezu izrade detaljnijeg plana ovaj alat ne provjerava, pa redak **Mogućnost"
" gradnje** uvijek kaže da nije utvrđena."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:80
msgid ""
"**Status** is the short answer: inside a settlement building area, in a "
"detached building area outside a settlement, touching a building area below "
"the overlap threshold, or outside building areas. The **Zones** table lists "
"every zone that covers part of the parcel, with its **Code** (for example "
"`T3` for a camp or `GPN` for a settlement area), its **Designation** as "
"written in the plan, the **Zone** name, the **Plan** it was read from and the"
" share of the parcel it covers (**Overlap**). The yellow note at the end is "
"the warning that must go with any use of this answer."
msgstr ""
"**Status** je kratki odgovor: unutar građevinskog područja naselja, u "
"izdvojenom građevinskom području izvan naselja, dodiruje građevinsko područje"
" ispod praga preklopa ili izvan građevinskih područja. Tablica **Zone** "
"navodi svaku zonu koja pokriva dio čestice, s njezinom oznakom (**Šifra**, na"
" primjer `T3` za kamp ili `GPN` za područje naselja), namjenom kako je "
"zapisana u planu (**Namjena**), nazivom zone (**Zona**), planom iz kojega je "
"očitana (**Plan**) i udjelom čestice koji pokriva (**Preklop**). Žuta "
"napomena na kraju upozorenje je koje mora pratiti svaku uporabu ovog "
"odgovora."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:92
msgid ""
"`--format` chooses the form of the answer. `table` is what you see above. "
"`json` gives the same data for other programs, including the plan identifier "
"and the county and municipality of the zone. `csv` gives one line per zone "
"for a spreadsheet, including the zones under the threshold, which are marked "
"in the `match` column. `geojson` gives the zone outlines for a mapping "
"program, marked the same way; add `--show-geometry` to include them in the "
"`json` form as well."
msgstr ""
"`--oblik` bira oblik odgovora. `tablica` je ono što vidite gore. `json` daje "
"iste podatke za druge programe, uključujući oznaku plana te županiju i općinu"
" zone. `csv` daje jedan redak po zoni za tablicu, uključujući zone ispod "
"praga, koje su označene u stupcu `podudaranje`. `geojson` daje obrise zona za"
" kartografski program, označene na isti način; dodajte `--geometrija` da ih "
"uključite i u oblik `json`."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:100
msgid ""
"Zones that cover only a sliver of the parcel are listed separately, below the"
" table, because plan boundaries are drawn on small-scale maps and rarely "
"follow parcel lines exactly. `--min-overlap` sets that threshold as a "
"percentage of the parcel, between 0 and 100; the usual value is 2."
msgstr ""
"Zone koje pokrivaju tek rub čestice navode se odvojeno, ispod tablice, jer se"
" granice planova crtaju na kartama sitnog mjerila i rijetko točno prate "
"granice čestica. `--najmanji-preklop` postavlja taj prag kao postotak "
"čestice, između 0 i 100; uobičajena vrijednost je 2."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:105
msgid "To keep the answer, write it to a file with `--output`:"
msgstr "Da biste odgovor sačuvali, zapišite ga u datoteku pomoću `--datoteka`:"

#: commands/get-zoning.md:137
msgid ""
"If the answer says the building areas could not be reached, the plan service "
"is down or the tool is not set up for it; ask the person who installed the "
"tool. Other messages are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako odgovor kaže da građevinska područja nisu dostupna, servis planova ne "
"radi ili alat za njega nije postavljen; obratite se osobi koja je alat "
"instalirala. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o "
"pogreškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:143
msgid ""
"[get-geometry](get-geometry.md) shows the parcel boundary the answer is based"
" on."
msgstr ""
"[granica](get-geometry.md) prikazuje granicu čestice na kojoj se odgovor "
"temelji."

#: commands/get-zoning.md:144
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows what the cadastre records for the parcel."
msgstr "[čestica](get-parcel.md) prikazuje što katastar bilježi o čestici."

#: commands/info.md:9
msgid "Check that the tool is set up"
msgstr "Provjera je li alat postavljen"

#: commands/info.md:11
msgid ""
"Shows the version of the tool, the server it talks to, and the boundary data "
"it has stored on your computer. This is the first thing to run after "
"installation, and the first thing to run when something does not work."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje verziju alata, poslužitelj s kojim razgovara i podatke o granicama "
"koje je pohranio na vašem računalu. To je prvo što pokrećete nakon "
"instalacije i prvo što pokrećete kad nešto ne radi."

#: commands/info.md:17
msgid "The tool has just been installed and you want to confirm it works."
msgstr "Alat je upravo instaliran i želite potvrditi da radi."

#: commands/info.md:18
msgid ""
"A command failed and you want to see whether the tool is pointed at the right"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Naredba nije uspjela i želite vidjeti je li alat usmjeren na pravi "
"poslužitelj."

#: commands/info.md:60
msgid ""
"**API Base** is the address of the server the tool talks to. For practice it "
"is the address of the practice server on your own computer. **Cache "
"Information** lists the municipalities whose boundary data is stored on your "
"computer, and the **Response cache** line says whether answers from the "
"server are kept in memory while a command runs (they are, unless it says "
"`off`). **API Settings** shows how long the tool waits between requests and "
"how long it waits for an answer."
msgstr ""
"**API osnova** je adresa poslužitelja s kojim alat razgovara. Za vježbu to je"
" adresa probnog poslužitelja na vašem računalu. **Informacije o "
"predmemoriji** ispisuje općine čiji su podaci o granicama pohranjeni na vašem"
" računalu; alat tu pohranu naziva predmemorijom. Redak **Predmemorija "
"odgovora** kaže čuvaju li se odgovori poslužitelja u memoriji dok naredba "
"radi (čuvaju se, osim ako piše `off`). **API postavke** pokazuje koliko alat "
"čeka između zahtjeva i koliko dugo čeka odgovor."

#: commands/info.md:70
msgid "None. If the tool prints this screen, it is installed correctly."
msgstr "Nema ih. Ako alat ispiše ovaj zaslon, ispravno je instaliran."

#: commands/info.md:78
msgid ""
"If Terminal says the command is not found, the tool is not installed for your"
" user account, or Terminal was opened before the installation finished. Close"
" Terminal, open it again and retry. If it still fails, ask the person who "
"installed the tool."
msgstr ""
"Ako Terminal kaže da naredba nije pronađena, alat nije instaliran za vaš "
"korisnički račun ili je Terminal otvoren prije nego što je instalacija "
"završila. Zatvorite Terminal, otvorite ga ponovno i pokušajte opet. Ako i "
"dalje ne radi, obratite se osobi koja je instalirala alat."

#: commands/info.md:85
msgid ""
"[cache-list](cache-list.md) shows the stored boundary data in more detail."
msgstr ""
"[predmemorija popis](cache-list.md) detaljnije prikazuje pohranjene podatke o"
" granicama."

#: commands/info.md:86
msgid "[Start here](../start-here.md) is the tutorial."
msgstr "[Počnite ovdje](../start-here.md) je vodič za početak."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:9
msgid "List the books of deposited contracts"
msgstr "Popis knjiga položenih ugovora"

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:11
msgid ""
"Besides the main books, the land registry keeps books of deposited contracts "
"(knjiga položenih ugovora, KPU). They hold flats and business premises that "
"were sold before their building had a land registry unit. This command lists "
"those books with the land registry office that keeps each one."
msgstr ""
"Osim glavnih knjiga, zemljišna knjiga vodi i knjige položenih ugovora (KPU). "
"U njima su stanovi i poslovni prostori prodani prije nego što je zgrada "
"dobila zemljišnoknjižni uložak. Ova naredba ispisuje te knjige zajedno sa "
"zemljišnoknjižnim odjelom koji svaku od njih vodi."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:18
msgid ""
"A flat you are checking is not in any land registry unit and you suspect it "
"is recorded in a book of deposited contracts."
msgstr ""
"Stan koji provjeravate nije ni u jednom zemljišnoknjižnom ulošku i sumnjate "
"da je upisan u knjigu položenih ugovora."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:19
msgid ""
"You want to know which land registry offices keep such books for a place."
msgstr ""
"Želite znati koji zemljišnoknjižni odjeli vode takve knjige za neko mjesto."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:23
msgid ""
"You need the name of the place, usually the town or the cadastral "
"municipality, as it appears on your document. Without a name the tool lists "
"every book it knows, which can be long."
msgstr ""
"Treba vam naziv mjesta, obično grada ili katastarske općine, kako je napisan "
"na vašem dokumentu. Bez naziva alat ispisuje sve knjige koje poznaje, a taj "
"popis može biti dugačak."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:50
msgid ""
"**Book ID** is the number of the book, and the last two columns name the land"
" registry office (zemljišnoknjižni odjel) that keeps it."
msgstr ""
"**ID knjige** je broj knjige, a posljednja dva stupca imenuju "
"zemljišnoknjižni odjel koji je vodi."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:55
msgid ""
"Add `--office` with the number of a land registry office to list only its "
"books, or `--count-only` to get only the number of books. `--format csv` with"
" `--output` keeps the list as a spreadsheet file."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--office` s brojem zemljišnoknjižnog odjela da biste ispisali samo "
"njegove knjige, ili `--count-only` da biste dobili samo broj knjiga. "
"`--format csv` uz `--output` sprema popis kao tablicu."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:59
msgid ""
"The tool cannot yet open a book of deposited contracts the way it opens a "
"land registry unit; it only finds the book. Ask the land registry office "
"named in the list for the record itself."
msgstr ""
"Alat još ne može otvoriti knjigu položenih ugovora onako kako otvara "
"zemljišnoknjižni uložak; on knjigu samo pronalazi. Za sam upis obratite se "
"zemljišnoknjižnom odjelu navedenom u popisu."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:76
msgid "If no book has the name you typed, the tool says so:"
msgstr "Ako nijedna knjiga nema naziv koji ste upisali, alat to kaže:"

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:84
msgid ""
"Try a shorter part of the name, or leave `--search` out to see the whole "
"list. Other messages are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte s kraćim dijelom naziva ili izostavite `--search` da biste vidjeli "
"cijeli popis. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o "
"greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:89
msgid ""
"[list-main-books](list-main-books.md) lists the main books, where most land "
"registry units are."
msgstr ""
"[list-main-books](list-main-books.md) ispisuje glavne knjige, u kojima je "
"većina zemljišnoknjižnih uložaka."

#: commands/list-books-of-dc.md:90
msgid "[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) reads a land registry unit."
msgstr "[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) daje uvid u zemljišnoknjižni uložak."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:9
msgid "Find the main book of a cadastral municipality"
msgstr "Pronađite glavnu knjigu katastarske općine"

#: commands/list-main-books.md:11
msgid ""
"The land registry keeps its units in main books (glavne knjige), usually one "
"per cadastral municipality. This command finds a main book by name and shows "
"the number the tool calls the main book ID, together with the court that "
"keeps the book."
msgstr ""
"Zemljišna knjiga vodi uloške u glavnim knjigama, u pravilu po jednoj za svaku"
" katastarsku općinu. Ova naredba pronalazi glavnu knjigu po nazivu i "
"prikazuje broj koji alat zove identifikator glavne knjige (main book ID), "
"zajedno sa sudom koji knjigu vodi."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:18
msgid ""
"You have a land registry unit number from a document and know the cadastral "
"municipality, but not the main book ID that [get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) "
"asks for."
msgstr ""
"S dokumenta imate broj zemljišnoknjižnog uloška i znate katastarsku općinu, "
"ali ne i identifikator glavne knjige koji traži [get-lr-unit](get-lr-"
"unit.md)."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:19
msgid ""
"You want to know which municipal court keeps the land registry for a place."
msgstr "Želite znati koji općinski sud vodi zemljišnu knjigu za neko mjesto."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:23
msgid ""
"You need the name of the cadastral municipality (katastarska općina) as it is"
" written on your document. The main book normally carries the same name."
msgstr ""
"Treba vam naziv katastarske općine kako je napisan na vašem dokumentu. Glavna"
" knjiga u pravilu nosi isti naziv."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:49
msgid ""
"**Main Book ID** is the number to give after `--main-book` in [get-lr-"
"unit](get-lr-unit.md). **Court** is the municipal court whose land registry "
"department keeps the book."
msgstr ""
"**ID glavne knjige** je broj koji zadajete nakon `--main-book` u naredbi "
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md). **Sud** je općinski sud čiji zemljišnoknjižni "
"odjel vodi knjigu."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:55
msgid ""
"If you do not want to look the number up first, give the name straight to "
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) with `--main-book-name`; the tool runs this "
"search for you and uses the book it finds:"
msgstr ""
"Ako broj ne želite prvo tražiti, zadajte naziv izravno naredbi [get-lr-"
"unit](get-lr-unit.md) opcijom `--main-book-name`; alat će ovu pretragu "
"obaviti za vas i upotrijebiti knjigu koju pronađe:"

#: commands/list-main-books.md:63
msgid ""
"Add `--office` with the number of a land registry office to list every main "
"book that office keeps, or `--count-only` to get only the number of books. "
"`--format csv` with `--output` keeps the list as a spreadsheet file."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--office` s brojem zemljišnoknjižnog odjela da biste ispisali sve "
"glavne knjige koje taj odjel vodi, ili `--count-only` da biste dobili samo "
"broj knjiga. `--format csv` uz `--output` sprema popis kao tablicu."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:80
msgid "If no main book has the name you typed, the tool says so:"
msgstr "Ako nijedna glavna knjiga nema naziv koji ste upisali, alat to kaže:"

#: commands/list-main-books.md:88
msgid ""
"Check the spelling of the cadastral municipality on your document, or search "
"for part of the name. Other messages are explained on the [errors "
"page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite kako je katastarska općina napisana na vašem dokumentu ili "
"pretražite dio naziva. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o "
"greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:94
msgid ""
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) reads the unit once you have the main book."
msgstr ""
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) daje uvid u uložak kad imate glavnu knjigu."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:95
msgid ""
"[list-books-of-dc](list-books-of-dc.md) lists the books of deposited "
"contracts, the other kind of land registry book."
msgstr ""
"[list-books-of-dc](list-books-of-dc.md) ispisuje knjige položenih ugovora, "
"drugu vrstu zemljišnoknjižne knjige."

#: commands/list-main-books.md:96
msgid ""
"[search-municipality](search-municipality.md) finds the cadastral "
"municipality itself."
msgstr ""
"[search-municipality](search-municipality.md) pronalazi samu katastarsku "
"općinu."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:9
msgid "List the cadastral municipalities of an office"
msgstr "Popis katastarskih općina jednog ureda"

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:11
msgid ""
"Shows the cadastral municipalities with their registration numbers, filtered "
"by cadastral office, by department, or by part of a name."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje katastarske općine s njihovim šiframa, filtrirane po katastarskom "
"uredu, po odjelu ili po dijelu naziva."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:16
msgid ""
"You work with one cadastral office and want the numbers of all its "
"municipalities on one sheet."
msgstr ""
"Radite s jednim katastarskim uredom i želite šifre svih njegovih općina na "
"jednom listu."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:17
msgid ""
"You want to check which department a municipality belongs to before you "
"contact the office."
msgstr ""
"Želite provjeriti kojem odjelu općina pripada prije nego se obratite uredu."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:21
msgid ""
"You need the number of the cadastral office. The [list-offices](list-"
"offices.md) page shows all of them."
msgstr ""
"Trebate broj katastarskog ureda. Stranica [uredi](list-offices.md) prikazuje "
"sve urede."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:63
msgid ""
"**Code** is the number to give after `-m` in the other commands. The first "
"line tells you how many municipalities the office has."
msgstr ""
"**Šifra** je matični broj općine koji u ostalim naredbama upisujete iza "
"`-ko`. Prvi redak kaže koliko općina ured ima."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:68
msgid ""
"Add `--department` to narrow the list to one department of the office, or "
"`--search` with part of a name to look for one municipality:"
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--odjel` da popis suzite na jedan odjel ureda, ili `--traži` s "
"dijelom naziva da potražite jednu općinu:"

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:75
msgid ""
"Without any filter the tool lists every municipality it knows, which is a "
"long list. Add `--count-only` to get only the number, or `--format csv` with "
"`--output` to keep the list as a spreadsheet file."
msgstr ""
"Bez ikakvog filtra alat ispisuje sve općine koje poznaje, a to je dug popis. "
"Dodajte `--samo-broj` da dobijete samo broj, ili `--oblik csv` s `--datoteka`"
" da popis spremite kao datoteku za tablice."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:92
msgid "If the office number is wrong, you will see this:"
msgstr "Ako je broj ureda pogrešan, vidjet ćete ovo:"

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:100
msgid ""
"Check the number on the [list-offices](list-offices.md) page. Other messages "
"are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite broj na stranici [uredi](list-offices.md). Ostale poruke "
"objašnjene su na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:105
msgid "[search-municipality](search-municipality.md) searches by name."
msgstr "[traži-općinu](search-municipality.md) pretražuje po nazivu."

#: commands/list-municipalities.md:106
msgid "[list-offices](list-offices.md) gives the office numbers."
msgstr "[uredi](list-offices.md) daje brojeve ureda."

#: commands/list-offices.md:9
msgid "List the cadastral offices"
msgstr "Popis katastarskih ureda"

#: commands/list-offices.md:11
msgid ""
"Shows every regional cadastral office (područni ured za katastar) with its "
"number. You need the number to list the municipalities of an office."
msgstr ""
"Prikazuje sve područne urede za katastar s njihovim brojevima. Broj vam treba"
" da biste ispisali općine nekog ureda."

#: commands/list-offices.md:16
msgid "You want to know which office is responsible for an area."
msgstr "Želite znati koji je ured nadležan za neko područje."

#: commands/list-offices.md:17
msgid "Another command asks for an office number and you do not know it."
msgstr "Druga naredba traži broj ureda, a vi ga ne znate."

#: commands/list-offices.md:21
msgid "Nothing. This command takes no input."
msgstr "Ništa. Ova naredba ne traži unos."

#: commands/list-offices.md:86
msgid ""
"**ID** is the office number. Use it with `--office` on the [list-"
"municipalities](list-municipalities.md) page."
msgstr ""
"**ID** je broj ureda. Koristite ga uz `--ured` na stranici [općine](list-"
"municipalities.md)."

#: commands/list-offices.md:91
msgid ""
"To keep the list as a file, add `--format csv` and `--output` with a file "
"name:"
msgstr ""
"Da popis spremite u datoteku, dodajte `--oblik csv` i `--datoteka` s nazivom "
"datoteke:"

#: commands/list-offices.md:106
msgid ""
"This command only fails when the tool cannot reach the practice server. The "
"message is explained on the [errors page](../errors.md); ask the person who "
"installed the tool to start the server."
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba ne uspijeva samo kad alat ne može doseći probni poslužitelj. "
"Poruka je objašnjena na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md); zamolite osobu "
"koja je instalirala alat da pokrene poslužitelj."

#: commands/list-offices.md:112
msgid "[list-municipalities](list-municipalities.md) uses the office number."
msgstr "[općine](list-municipalities.md) koristi broj ureda."

#: commands/list-offices.md:113
msgid "[info](info.md) shows which server the tool is talking to."
msgstr "[info](info.md) pokazuje s kojim poslužiteljem alat razgovara."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:9
msgid "Find the number of a cadastral municipality"
msgstr "Matični broj katastarske općine"

#: commands/search-municipality.md:11
msgid ""
"Every cadastral municipality (katastarska općina, k.o.) has a registration "
"number. This command finds it from the name, or lists the municipalities that"
" belong to a cadastral office."
msgstr ""
"Svaka katastarska općina (k.o.) ima matični broj, koji alat ispisuje kao "
"šifru. Ova je naredba pronalazi iz naziva ili ispisuje općine koje pripadaju "
"nekom katastarskom uredu."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:17
msgid ""
"Two municipalities have the same or a similar name and you want to be sure "
"which one you are looking at."
msgstr ""
"Dvije općine imaju isti ili sličan naziv i želite biti sigurni koju gledate."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:18
msgid ""
"A command refused the municipality name and you need the number instead."
msgstr "Naredba je odbila naziv općine i umjesto njega trebate šifru."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:19
msgid ""
"You want to know which cadastral office (područni ured za katastar) and "
"department a municipality belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Želite znati kojem područnom uredu za katastar i odjelu općina pripada."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:23
msgid "You need the name of the municipality, or part of it."
msgstr "Trebate naziv općine ili njegov dio."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:48
msgid ""
"**Code** is the registration number you can give to any other command after "
"`-m`. **Office** and **Department** are the numbers of the cadastral office "
"and its department."
msgstr ""
"**Šifra** je matični broj koji svakoj drugoj naredbi možete zadati iza `-ko`."
" **Ured** i **Odjel** su brojevi katastarskog ureda i njegova odjela."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:54
msgid ""
"To list every municipality of one office, give the office number with "
"`--office`. You can combine it with a name to narrow the list:"
msgstr ""
"Da ispišete sve općine jednog ureda, zadajte broj ureda uz `--ured`. Možete "
"ga kombinirati s nazivom da suzite popis:"

#: commands/search-municipality.md:61
msgid ""
"If you only want to know how many municipalities match, add `--count-only`. "
"To keep the list as a file, add `--format csv` and `--output` with a file "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Ako samo želite znati koliko se općina podudara, dodajte `--samo-broj`. Da "
"popis spremite u datoteku, dodajte `--oblik csv` i `--datoteka` s nazivom "
"datoteke."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:77
msgid "If nothing matches, you will see this:"
msgstr "Ako se ništa ne podudara, vidjet ćete ovo:"

#: commands/search-municipality.md:85
msgid ""
"Try a shorter part of the name, or list the whole office with `--office` and "
"look for the name in the list. Other messages are explained on the [errors "
"page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte s kraćim dijelom naziva, ili ispišite cijeli ured uz `--ured` i "
"potražite naziv na popisu. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o "
"greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:91
msgid ""
"[list-municipalities](list-municipalities.md) does the same job with a "
"different set of filters."
msgstr "[općine](list-municipalities.md) radi isti posao s drukčijim filtrima."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:92
msgid ""
"[list-offices](list-offices.md) shows the office numbers to use with "
"`--office`."
msgstr "[uredi](list-offices.md) prikazuje brojeve ureda za `--ured`."

#: commands/search-municipality.md:93
msgid "[search](search.md) is where you use the number you found."
msgstr "[pretraži](search.md) je mjesto gdje pronađenu šifru koristite."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:9
msgid "Find a possession sheet by its number"
msgstr "Pronađite posjedovni list po broju"

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:11
msgid ""
"A possession sheet (posjedovni list) is the cadastre's record of who "
"possesses a group of parcels. This command checks whether a sheet number "
"exists in a cadastral municipality and shows the number the cadastre uses "
"internally for it."
msgstr ""
"Posjedovni list je katastarski zapis o tome tko posjeduje skupinu čestica. "
"Ova naredba provjerava postoji li broj lista u katastarskoj općini i "
"prikazuje broj pod kojim ga katastar interno vodi."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:18
msgid ""
"A document names a possession sheet number and you want to confirm it exists "
"in that cadastral municipality."
msgstr ""
"Dokument navodi broj posjedovnog lista i želite potvrditi da on postoji u toj"
" katastarskoj općini."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:19
msgid ""
"You typed part of a sheet number and want to see which sheets start with it."
msgstr ""
"Upisali ste dio broja lista i želite vidjeti koji listovi njime počinju."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:23
msgid ""
"You need the possession sheet number and the cadastral municipality "
"(katastarska općina), both usually printed on the extract from the possession"
" sheet."
msgstr ""
"Trebaju vam broj posjedovnog lista i katastarska općina; oboje je obično "
"otisnuto na izvatku iz posjedovnog lista."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:51
msgid ""
"Every sheet whose number starts with what you typed is listed. **Sheet ID** "
"is the cadastre's internal number for the sheet; you will not normally need "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Ispisan je svaki list čiji broj počinje onim što ste upisali. **ID lista** je"
" interni broj lista u katastru; u pravilu vam neće trebati."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:57
msgid ""
"This command only confirms the sheet. For the sheet itself, with its "
"possessors and every parcel on it, use [get-possession-sheet](get-possession-"
"sheet.md) with the exact number."
msgstr ""
"Ova naredba samo potvrđuje list. Za sam list, s posjednicima i svim česticama"
" na njemu, upotrijebite [get-possession-sheet](get-possession-sheet.md) s "
"točnim brojem."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:61
msgid "`--format json` with `--output` keeps the result as a file."
msgstr "`--format json` uz `--output` sprema rezultat kao datoteku."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:74
msgid ""
"If no sheet starts with the number you typed, the tool stops with this line:"
msgstr ""
"Ako nijedan list ne počinje brojem koji ste upisali, alat staje s ovim "
"retkom:"

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:82
msgid ""
"Check the number and the cadastral municipality on your document. Other "
"messages are explained on the [errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite broj i katastarsku općinu na vašem dokumentu. Ostale poruke "
"objašnjene su na [stranici o greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:87
msgid ""
"[get-possession-sheet](get-possession-sheet.md) shows a sheet with its "
"possessors and parcels."
msgstr ""
"[get-possession-sheet](get-possession-sheet.md) prikazuje list s njegovim "
"posjednicima i česticama."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:88
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows the possession sheet of a parcel with its "
"possessors."
msgstr ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) prikazuje posjedovni list čestice s njezinim "
"posjednicima."

#: commands/search-possession-sheet.md:89
msgid "[search](search.md) finds a parcel by its number."
msgstr "[search](search.md) pronalazi česticu po broju."

#: commands/search.md:9
msgid "Check a parcel quickly"
msgstr "Brza provjera čestice"

#: commands/search.md:11
msgid ""
"Type a parcel number and the cadastral municipality, and get the basics on "
"one screen: where the parcel is, how big it is, what the land is used for, "
"and how many people the cadastre records on it."
msgstr ""
"Upišite broj čestice i katastarsku općinu i dobit ćete osnovne podatke na "
"jednom zaslonu: gdje je čestica, kolika je, čemu zemljište služi i koliko "
"osoba katastar na njoj vodi."

#: commands/search.md:17
msgid ""
"A client mentions a parcel and you want to confirm it exists before you go "
"any further."
msgstr ""
"Klijent spominje česticu i želite potvrditi da postoji prije nego nastavite."

#: commands/search.md:18
msgid ""
"You need the area and the land use of a parcel for a contract or a valuation."
msgstr ""
"Trebate površinu i način uporabe zemljišta čestice za ugovor ili procjenu."

#: commands/search.md:19
msgid ""
"You want the registration number of the municipality and the parcel's "
"internal number for a later, more detailed lookup."
msgstr ""
"Želite matični broj općine i interni broj čestice za kasniji, detaljniji "
"dohvat."

#: commands/search.md:23
msgid ""
"You need two things: the parcel number (broj katastarske čestice, for example"
" 103/2) and the cadastral municipality (katastarska općina) it belongs to. "
"Both are on any extract from the cadastre or the land registry, and on most "
"contracts."
msgstr ""
"Trebate dvoje: broj katastarske čestice (na primjer 103/2) i katastarsku "
"općinu kojoj pripada. Oboje je na svakom izvatku iz katastra ili zemljišne "
"knjige i na većini ugovora."

#: commands/search.md:27
msgid ""
"You can give the municipality by name (SAVAR) or by its registration number "
"(334979). The tool accepts either."
msgstr ""
"Općinu možete zadati nazivom (SAVAR) ili šifrom (334979). Alat prihvaća "
"oboje."

# fuzzy match of: Read the lines from top to bottom. **Parcel Number** and
# **Municipality** confirm that the tool found the parcel you meant. **Area**
# is the surface in square metres. **Land Use** is the cadastral culture, in
# the wording of the cadastre. **Building Permitted** tells you whether the
# cadastre records a building right. **Owners** is the number of people
# recorded on the parcel in the cadastre, not in the land registry.
#: commands/search.md:55
msgid ""
"Read the lines from top to bottom. **Parcel Number** and **Municipality** "
"confirm that the tool found the parcel you meant. **Area** is the surface in "
"square metres. **Land Use** is the cadastral culture, in the wording of the "
"cadastre. **Building Permitted** tells you whether building is allowed on the"
" parcel according to the cadastre. **Possessors** is the number of people the"
" cadastre records on the parcel. They are possessors (posjednici), not "
"necessarily the legal owners; the land registry has those."
msgstr ""
"Čitajte retke odozgo prema dolje. **Broj čestice** i **Općina** potvrđuju da "
"je alat pronašao česticu koju ste mislili. **Površina** je površina u "
"četvornim metrima. **Način uporabe** je katastarska kultura, u rječniku "
"katastra. **Dozvoljeno građenje** kaže je li prema katastru na čestici "
"dopušteno graditi. **Posjednici** je broj osoba koje katastar vodi na "
"čestici. To su posjednici, a ne nužno vlasnici; vlasnike vodi zemljišna "
"knjiga."

#: commands/search.md:63
msgid ""
"The last line suggests the command for the full details. Copy it if you need "
"more than this summary."
msgstr ""
"Zadnji redak predlaže naredbu za potpune detalje. Kopirajte je ako trebate "
"više od ovog sažetka."

#: commands/search.md:68
msgid ""
"The part after `-m` is the municipality. It can be a name or a number. If two"
" municipalities share a name, use the number, which you can find with "
"[search-municipality](search-municipality.md)."
msgstr ""
"Dio iza `-ko` je općina. Može biti naziv ili šifra. Ako dvije općine dijele "
"naziv, upotrijebite šifru, koju možete pronaći naredbom [traži-"
"općinu](search-municipality.md)."

#: commands/search.md:72
msgid ""
"If you only know the beginning of a parcel number, add `--partial` to see "
"every parcel that starts with what you typed:"
msgstr ""
"Ako znate samo početak broja čestice, dodajte `--djelomično` da vidite sve "
"čestice koje počinju onim što ste upisali:"

#: commands/search.md:79
msgid ""
"To keep the result as a file instead of reading it on screen, add `--format "
"json` or `--format csv` and `--output` with a file name. A JSON file can be "
"read by other programs; a CSV file opens in a spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Da rezultat spremite u datoteku umjesto čitanja na zaslonu, dodajte `--oblik "
"json` ili `--oblik csv` i `--datoteka` s nazivom datoteke. JSON datoteku mogu"
" čitati drugi programi; CSV datoteka otvara se u programu za tablice."

#: commands/search.md:99
msgid ""
"If the parcel number does not exist in that municipality, the tool says so "
"and stops:"
msgstr "Ako broj čestice ne postoji u toj općini, alat to kaže i staje:"

#: commands/search.md:107
msgid ""
"Check the number on your document. Parcel numbers often contain a slash, and "
"103 is not the same parcel as 103/2."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite broj na svom dokumentu. Brojevi čestica često sadrže kosu crtu, a "
"103 nije ista čestica kao 103/2."

#: commands/search.md:110
msgid ""
"If the municipality is not recognised, the message names it. Check the "
"spelling, or use the number instead. Other messages are explained on the "
"[errors page](../errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ako općina nije prepoznata, poruka je imenuje. Provjerite pravopis ili "
"umjesto naziva upotrijebite šifru. Ostale poruke objašnjene su na [stranici o"
" greškama](../errors.md)."

#: commands/search.md:116
msgid ""
"[get-parcel](get-parcel.md) shows everything the cadastre holds about the "
"parcel, including the recorded possessors."
msgstr ""
"[čestica](get-parcel.md) prikazuje sve što katastar ima o čestici, "
"uključujući upisane posjednike."

#: commands/search.md:117
msgid ""
"[get-lr-unit](get-lr-unit.md) shows the land registry unit: owners, shares "
"and encumbrances."
msgstr ""
"[uložak](get-lr-unit.md) prikazuje zemljišnoknjižni uložak: vlasnike, udjele "
"i terete."

#: commands/search.md:118
msgid ""
"[search-municipality](search-municipality.md) finds the number of a cadastral"
" municipality."
msgstr ""
"[traži-općinu](search-municipality.md) pronalazi šifru katastarske općine."

#: errors.md:9
msgid "What the error messages mean"
msgstr "Što znače poruke o greškama"

#: errors.md:11
msgid ""
"When something goes wrong, the tool stops and prints one line in red. This "
"page lists the messages and says what to do about each."
msgstr ""
"Kada nešto ne uspije, alat staje i ispisuje jedan redak crvenom bojom. Ova "
"stranica ispisuje te poruke i kaže što učiniti kod svake."

#: errors.md:36
msgid "Messages about what you typed"
msgstr "Poruke o onome što ste upisali"

#: errors.md:38
msgid ""
"**Parcel not found** means the parcel number does not exist in the "
"municipality you named. Check the number on your document, including the part"
" after the slash, and check that you named the right municipality."
msgstr ""
"**Čestica nije pronađena** znači da broj čestice ne postoji u općini koju ste"
" naveli. Provjerite broj na svom dokumentu, uključujući dio iza kose crte, i "
"provjerite jeste li naveli pravu općinu."

#: errors.md:42
msgid ""
"**Municipality not found** means the name or number after `-m` is not known. "
"Check the spelling, or find the registration number with [search-"
"municipality](commands/search-municipality.md) and use that instead."
msgstr ""
"**Općina nije pronađena** znači da naziv ili šifra iza `-ko` nisu poznati. "
"Provjerite pravopis ili pronađite šifru naredbom [traži-"
"općinu](commands/search-municipality.md) i upotrijebite nju."

#: errors.md:46
msgid ""
"**Land registry unit not found** means the unit number and main book you gave"
" do not match a unit. Check both numbers. If you started from a parcel, the "
"parcel may not be entered in the land registry yet."
msgstr ""
"**Zemljišnoknjižni uložak nije pronađen** znači da broj uloška i glavna "
"knjiga koje ste zadali ne odgovaraju nijednom ulošku. Provjerite oba broja. "
"Ako ste krenuli od čestice, čestica možda još nije upisana u zemljišnu "
"knjigu."

#: errors.md:50
msgid "Messages about the connection"
msgstr "Poruke o vezi"

#: errors.md:52
msgid ""
"**Connection error** means the tool could not reach the server. For practice "
"use, the practice server on your computer is not running. Ask the person who "
"installed the tool to start it, then run the command again."
msgstr ""
"**Greška veze** znači da alat nije mogao doseći poslužitelj. Kod vježbe to "
"znači da probni poslužitelj na vašem računalu nije pokrenut. Zamolite osobu "
"koja je instalirala alat da ga pokrene, pa ponovno pokrenite naredbu."

#: errors.md:56
msgid ""
"**Request timed out** means the server did not answer in time. Wait a moment "
"and run the command again."
msgstr ""
"**Isteklo je vrijeme zahtjeva** znači da poslužitelj nije odgovorio na "
"vrijeme. Pričekajte trenutak i ponovno pokrenite naredbu."

#: errors.md:59
msgid ""
"**Rate limit exceeded** means requests were sent too quickly. The tool "
"already spaces its requests; wait a minute and try again."
msgstr ""
"**Prekoračeno ograničenje broja zahtjeva** znači da su zahtjevi slani "
"prebrzo. Alat već razmiče svoje zahtjeve; pričekajte minutu i pokušajte "
"ponovno."

#: errors.md:62
msgid ""
"**Server error** and **Invalid response from server** mean the server "
"answered but not in the expected way. Try again later. If it keeps happening,"
" tell the person who installed the tool."
msgstr ""
"**Greška poslužitelja** i **Neispravan odgovor poslužitelja** znače da je "
"poslužitelj odgovorio, ali ne na očekivani način. Pokušajte kasnije. Ako se "
"ponavlja, recite osobi koja je instalirala alat."

#: errors.md:66
msgid "Messages from Terminal itself"
msgstr "Poruke samog Terminala"

#: errors.md:68
msgid ""
"If Terminal answers `command not found`, the tool is not installed for your "
"account or Terminal was opened before the installation finished. Close "
"Terminal, open it again, and retry. If it still fails, ask the person who "
"installed the tool."
msgstr ""
"Ako Terminal odgovori `command not found`, alat nije instaliran za vaš račun "
"ili je Terminal otvoren prije nego što je instalacija završila. Zatvorite "
"Terminal, otvorite ga ponovno i pokušajte opet. Ako i dalje ne radi, obratite"
" se osobi koja je instalirala alat."

#: errors.md:73
msgid ""
"If the tool prints `Missing option` or `No such option`, part of the command "
"is misspelt. Compare your line with the example on the command's page."
msgstr ""
"Ako alat ispiše `Nedostaje opcija` ili `Nepostojeća opcija`, dio naredbe je "
"pogrešno napisan. Usporedite svoj redak s primjerom na stranici te naredbe."

#: glossary.md:9
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "Pojmovnik"

#: glossary.md:11
msgid ""
"The words of the cadastre and the land registry, and where the tool shows "
"each of them. Croatian terms are given as they appear on official documents."
msgstr ""
"Riječi katastra i zemljišne knjige te gdje ih alat prikazuje. Pojmovi su "
"navedeni onako kako stoje na službenim ispravama."

#: glossary.md:14
msgid "| Term | What it means | Where you see it in the tool |"
msgstr "| Pojam | Što znači | Gdje ga vidite u alatu |"

#: glossary.md:16
msgid ""
"| Katastarska čestica (k.č.) | A parcel: one numbered piece of land in the "
"cadastre. | The parcel number you type after `search`, `get-parcel` and `get-"
"geometry`. |"
msgstr ""
"| Katastarska čestica (k.č.) | Čestica: jedan numerirani dio zemljišta u "
"katastru. | Broj čestice koji upisujete iza `pretraži`, `čestica` i "
"`granica`. |"

# fuzzy match of: | Katastarska općina (k.o.) | The cadastral municipality a
# parcel belongs to. Each has a name and a registration number. | The value
# after `-m` in most commands. [search-municipality](commands/search-
# municipality.md) finds the number. |
#: glossary.md:17
msgid ""
"| Katastarska općina (k.o.) | The cadastral municipality a parcel belongs to."
" Each has a name and a registration number (matični broj), which the tool "
"prints as its code. | The value after `-m` in most commands. [search-"
"municipality](commands/search-municipality.md) finds the number. |"
msgstr ""
"| Katastarska općina (k.o.) | Katastarska općina kojoj čestica pripada. Svaka"
" ima naziv i matični broj, koji alat ispisuje kao šifru. | Vrijednost iza "
"`-ko` u većini naredbi. [traži-općinu](commands/search-municipality.md) "
"pronalazi matični broj. |"

# fuzzy match of: | Posjedovni list | The possession sheet of the cadastre:
# who
# possesses a parcel according to the cadastre. Not proof of ownership. |
# [get-
# parcel](commands/get-parcel.md) with `--show-owners`. |
#: glossary.md:18
msgid ""
"| Posjedovni list | The possession sheet of the cadastre: who possesses a "
"parcel according to the cadastre. Not proof of ownership. | [get-possession-"
"sheet](commands/get-possession-sheet.md); [get-parcel](commands/get-"
"parcel.md) with `--show-owners`. |"
msgstr ""
"| Posjedovni list | Posjedovni list katastra: tko posjeduje česticu prema "
"katastru. Nije dokaz vlasništva. | [posjedovni-list](commands/get-possession-"
"sheet.md); [čestica](commands/get-parcel.md) uz `--posjednici`. |"

#: glossary.md:19
msgid ""
"| Posjednik | A possessor recorded in the cadastre. | The rows of the "
"possession sheet on [get-parcel](commands/get-parcel.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Posjednik | Posjednik upisan u katastru. | Reci posjedovnog lista na "
"[čestica](commands/get-parcel.md). |"

# fuzzy match of: | Zemljišnoknjižni uložak (ZK uložak) | The land registry
# unit: the record of the legal state of a property, kept by the land registry
# department of the municipal court. | [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md).
# Its number also appears on [get-parcel](commands/get-parcel.md) and in the
# batch results. |
#: glossary.md:20
msgid ""
"| Zemljišnoknjižni uložak (ZK uložak) | The land registry unit: the record of"
" the legal state of a property, kept by the land registry department of the "
"municipal court. | [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). Its number also "
"appears on [get-parcel](commands/get-parcel.md), for one parcel or a list. |"
msgstr ""
"| Zemljišnoknjižni uložak (ZK uložak) | Sadrži pravno stanje nekretnine; vodi"
" ga zemljišnoknjižni odjel općinskog suda. | [uložak](commands/get-lr-"
"unit.md). Njegov broj pojavljuje se i na [čestica](commands/get-parcel.md), "
"za jednu česticu ili za popis. |"

#: glossary.md:21
msgid ""
"| Čestica zgrade (zgr.) | A building parcel: a parcel of the old cadastre "
"that covers a building alone. Written `35/1 ZGR`, `35/1.ZGR` or `zgr. 35/1`; "
"it has no land registry unit of its own. | The parcel number on [get-"
"parcel](commands/get-parcel.md) and [search](commands/search.md), printed as "
"`zgr. 35/1`. |"
msgstr ""
"| Čestica zgrade (zgr.) | Čestica starog katastra koja obuhvaća samo zgradu. "
"Piše se `35/1 ZGR`, `35/1.ZGR` ili `zgr. 35/1`; nema vlastiti "
"zemljišnoknjižni uložak. | Broj čestice u naredbama [get-"
"parcel](commands/get-parcel.md) i [search](commands/search.md), ispisan kao "
"`zgr. 35/1`. |"

#: glossary.md:22
msgid ""
"| Glavna knjiga | The main book: the volume of the land registry that holds "
"the units of one cadastral municipality. | `--main-book` or `--main-book-"
"name` on [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md); [list-main-"
"books](commands/list-main-books.md) finds the number. |"
msgstr ""
"| Glavna knjiga | Svezak zemljišne knjige koji sadrži uloške jedne "
"katastarske općine. | `--main-book` ili `--main-book-name` u naredbi [get-lr-"
"unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md); [list-main-books](commands/list-main-"
"books.md) pronalazi broj. |"

#: glossary.md:23
msgid ""
"| Knjiga položenih ugovora (KPU) | The book of deposited contracts: the land "
"registry book for flats and business premises sold before their building had "
"a land registry unit. | [list-books-of-dc](commands/list-books-of-dc.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Knjiga položenih ugovora (KPU) | Zemljišnoknjižna knjiga za stanove i "
"poslovne prostore prodane prije nego što je zgrada dobila zemljišnoknjižni "
"uložak. | [list-books-of-dc](commands/list-books-of-dc.md). |"

#: glossary.md:24
msgid ""
"| Upis | A registration entry: the act by which an owner, a right or a note "
"was entered in the unit. Each owner's entry shows its order number, receipt "
"date and diary number. | The entry column of sheet B on [get-lr-"
"unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Upis | Čin kojim je vlasnik, pravo ili zabilježba unesen u uložak. Upis "
"svakog vlasnika prikazuje redni broj, datum zaprimanja i broj dnevnika. | "
"Stupac Upis u vlastovnici naredbe [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"

#: glossary.md:25
msgid ""
"| Posjedovnica (list A) | Sheet A: the parcels that make up the unit. | The "
"first table after the unit header on [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| Posjedovnica (list A) | List A: čestice koje čine uložak. | Prva tablica "
"iza zaglavlja uloška na [uložak](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"

#: glossary.md:26
msgid ""
"| Vlastovnica (list B) | Sheet B: the owners and their shares. | `--show-"
"owners` on [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Vlastovnica (list B) | List B: vlasnici i njihovi udjeli. | `--vlasnici` na"
" [uložak](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"

# fuzzy match of: | Teretovnica (list C) | Sheet C: encumbrances such as
# mortgages, easements and notes. | `--show-encumbrances` on [get-lr-
# unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |
#: glossary.md:27
msgid ""
"| Teretovnica (list C) | Sheet C: liens (mortgages), easements, real burdens "
"and notes. | `--show-encumbrances` on [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md)."
" |"
msgstr ""
"| Teretovnica (list C) | List C: založna prava (hipoteke), služnosti, stvarni"
" tereti i zabilježbe. | `--tereti` na [uložak](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"

#: glossary.md:28
msgid ""
"| Suvlasnički udio | A co-ownership share, written as a fraction such as 1/2."
" | The share column of sheet B. |"
msgstr ""
"| Suvlasnički udio | Udio u suvlasništvu, zapisan kao razlomak, na primjer "
"1/2. | Stupac udjela lista B. |"

# fuzzy match of: | Plomba | A note that a request has been received and not
# yet decided. The unit may change. | The pending entries line on [get-lr-
# unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md); `--plombe-detail` shows what each request
# is.
# |
#: glossary.md:29
msgid ""
"| Plomba | A mark that a request for registration (prijedlog za upis) has "
"been received and not yet decided. The unit may change. | The pending entries"
" line on [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md); `--plombe-detail` shows what"
" each request is. |"
msgstr ""
"| Plomba | Naznaka da je prijedlog za upis zaprimljen, a još nije riješen. "
"Uložak se može promijeniti. | Redak s plombama na [uložak](commands/get-lr-"
"unit.md); `--plombe` pokazuje o čemu je svaki prijedlog. |"

# fuzzy match of: | Dnevnik, broj Z | The diary of the land registry and the
# file number (Z-number) of a request. | The last diary number on [get-lr-
# unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md) and the file numbers of the pending entries.
# |
#: glossary.md:30
msgid ""
"| Dnevnik, broj Z | The diary of the land registry and the file number "
"(Z-number) of a request for registration. | The last diary number on [get-lr-"
"unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md) and the file numbers of the pending entries. |"
msgstr ""
"| Dnevnik, broj Z | Dnevnik zemljišne knjige i poslovni broj (Z-broj) "
"prijedloga za upis. | Zadnji broj dnevnika na [uložak](commands/get-lr-"
"unit.md) i poslovni brojevi plombi. |"

#: glossary.md:31
msgid ""
"| Etažno vlasništvo | Ownership of a special part of a property (a flat or "
"business premises), tied to a co-ownership share of the whole. | The unit "
"type row of the unit header on [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Etažno vlasništvo | Vlasništvo posebnog dijela nekretnine (stana ili "
"poslovnog prostora), povezano sa suvlasničkim dijelom cijele nekretnine. | "
"Redak tipa uloška u zaglavlju uloška na [uložak](commands/get-lr-unit.md). |"

# fuzzy match of: | Kultura, namjena zemljišta | The land use recorded in the
# cadastre, such as arable land, pasture or orchard. | The land use table on
# [get-parcel](commands/get-parcel.md). |
#: glossary.md:32
msgid ""
"| Kultura, način uporabe zemljišta | The land use recorded in the cadastre, "
"such as arable land, pasture or orchard. | The land use table on [get-"
"parcel](commands/get-parcel.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Kultura, način uporabe zemljišta | Način uporabe zemljišta upisan u "
"katastru, na primjer oranica, pašnjak ili voćnjak. | Tablica načina uporabe "
"na [čestica](commands/get-parcel.md). |"

# fuzzy match of: | OIB | The personal identification number of a person or
# company. | The OIB column of sheet B, when the registry has it. |
#: glossary.md:33
msgid ""
"| OIB | The personal identification number of a natural or legal person. | "
"The OIB column of sheet B, when the registry has it. |"
msgstr ""
"| OIB | Osobni identifikacijski broj fizičke ili pravne osobe. | Stupac OIB "
"lista B, kada ga zemljišna knjiga ima. |"

#: glossary.md:34
msgid ""
"| Područni ured za katastar | A regional cadastral office. | [list-"
"offices](commands/list-offices.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Područni ured za katastar | Područni ured za katastar. | "
"[uredi](commands/list-offices.md). |"

#: glossary.md:35
msgid ""
"| Granica čestice | The boundary of a parcel as coordinates. | [get-"
"geometry](commands/get-geometry.md) and [download-gis](commands/download-"
"gis.md). |"
msgstr ""
"| Granica čestice | Granica čestice zapisana koordinatama. | "
"[granica](commands/get-geometry.md) i [preuzmi-gis](commands/download-"
"gis.md). |"

#: glossary.md:36
msgid ""
"| HTRS96/TM (EPSG:3765) | The official coordinate system of Croatia, used for"
" all boundaries. | Every coordinate the tool prints. |"
msgstr ""
"| HTRS96/TM (EPSG:3765) | Službeni koordinatni sustav Hrvatske, koristi se za"
" sve granice. | Svaka koordinata koju alat ispiše. |"

#: install.md:9
msgid "Installation, for the person setting this up"
msgstr "Instalacija, za osobu koja postavlja alat"

#: install.md:11
msgid ""
"This page is for the technical colleague who installs the tool. The person "
"who will use it does not need to read it. It takes about ten minutes."
msgstr ""
"Ova je stranica za tehničkog kolegu koji instalira alat. Osoba koja će ga "
"koristiti ne mora je čitati. Traje oko deset minuta."

#: install.md:14
msgid "What you are installing"
msgstr "Što instalirate"

#: install.md:16
msgid ""
"`cadastral` is a command-line tool written in Python. It talks to a small "
"practice server, included in the same repository, that answers with made-up "
"cadastral data. Nothing here connects to the official Croatian systems, and "
"it must stay that way."
msgstr ""
"`uz` je alat naredbenog retka napisan u Pythonu. Razgovara s malim probnim "
"poslužiteljem, uključenim u isti repozitorij, koji odgovara izmišljenim "
"katastarskim podacima. Ništa ovdje ne spaja se na službene hrvatske sustave i"
" tako mora ostati."

#: install.md:21
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Preduvjeti"

#: install.md:23
msgid "Python 3.12 or newer."
msgstr "Python 3.12 ili noviji."

#: install.md:24
msgid "Git, to fetch the repository."
msgstr "Git, za dohvat repozitorija."

#: install.md:25
msgid ""
"A terminal the user can open: Terminal on macOS, Windows Terminal or "
"PowerShell on Windows, any terminal on Linux."
msgstr ""
"Terminal koji korisnik može otvoriti: Terminal na macOS-u, Windows Terminal "
"ili PowerShell na Windowsima, bilo koji terminal na Linuxu."

#: install.md:27
msgid "Step 1: fetch the repository and create an environment"
msgstr "Korak 1: dohvatite repozitorij i stvorite okruženje"

#: install.md:36
msgid ""
"On Windows, activate with `.venv\\Scripts\\activate` instead of the last "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Na Windowsima umjesto zadnjeg retka aktivirajte s `.venv\\Scripts\\activate`."

#: install.md:38
msgid "Step 2: install the tool and the practice server"
msgstr "Korak 2: instalirajte alat i probni poslužitelj"

#: install.md:45
msgid "Step 3: start the practice server"
msgstr "Korak 3: pokrenite probni poslužitelj"

#: install.md:47
msgid ""
"The practice server has to be running whenever the user works with the tool. "
"Start it in its own terminal window and leave that window open:"
msgstr ""
"Probni poslužitelj mora biti pokrenut kad god korisnik radi s alatom. "
"Pokrenite ga u zasebnom prozoru terminala i ostavite taj prozor otvoren:"

#: install.md:55
msgid ""
"It listens on `http://localhost:8000`. The tool uses that address unless told"
" otherwise, so no further configuration is needed for practice use."
msgstr ""
"Sluša na adresi `http://localhost:8000`. Alat koristi tu adresu ako mu nije "
"rečeno drukčije, pa za vježbu nije potrebno dodatno podešavanje."

#: install.md:58
msgid ""
"To have the server start automatically at login, create a user service "
"(launchd on macOS, a scheduled task on Windows, a systemd user unit on Linux)"
" that runs the two lines above inside the virtual environment."
msgstr ""
"Da se poslužitelj pokreće sam pri uključivanju računala, napravite korisnički"
" servis (launchd na macOS-u, zakazani zadatak na Windowsima, systemd "
"korisničku jedinicu na Linuxu) koji izvršava gornja dva retka unutar "
"virtualnog okruženja."

#: install.md:62
msgid "Step 4: choose the user's language"
msgstr "Korak 4: odaberite korisnikov jezik"

#: install.md:64
msgid ""
"The tool prints in Croatian by default. Set the `CADASTRAL_LANG` environment "
"variable in the user's shell profile to `hr` or `en` so that they never have "
"to pass `--lang`. For example, in `~/.zshrc`:"
msgstr ""
"Alat ispisuje na hrvatskom ako nije rečeno drukčije. Postavite varijablu "
"okruženja `CADASTRAL_LANG` u korisnikovu profilu ljuske na `hr` ili `en`, "
"tako da korisnik nikad ne mora zadavati `--jezik`. Na primjer, u `~/.zshrc`:"

#: install.md:72
msgid ""
"The documentation exists in both languages. Give the user the link to the "
"edition that matches this setting."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentacija postoji na oba jezika. Dajte korisniku poveznicu na izdanje "
"koje odgovara ovoj postavci."

#: install.md:75
msgid ""
"Step 2 installs two program names, `cadastral` and `uz`. They are the same "
"program. The Croatian documentation uses `uz` with Croatian command and "
"option names, such as `uz čestica 103/2 -ko SAVAR`; the English documentation"
" uses `cadastral` with English names. Every command accepts both spellings, "
"so a line copied from either edition works."
msgstr ""
"Korak 2 instalira dva naziva programa, `cadastral` i `uz`. To je isti "
"program. Hrvatska dokumentacija koristi `uz` s hrvatskim nazivima naredbi i "
"opcija, na primjer `uz čestica 103/2 -ko SAVAR`; engleska dokumentacija "
"koristi `cadastral` s engleskim nazivima. Svaka naredba prihvaća oba načina "
"pisanja, pa redak kopiran iz bilo kojeg izdanja radi."

#: install.md:81
msgid "Step 5: verify"
msgstr "Korak 5: provjerite"

#: install.md:83
msgid "Open a new terminal as the user and run:"
msgstr "Otvorite novi terminal kao korisnik i pokrenite:"

#: install.md:89
msgid "You should see this:"
msgstr "Trebali biste vidjeti ovo:"

#: install.md:116
msgid "Hand-over checklist"
msgstr "Popis za primopredaju"

#: install.md:118
msgid ""
"The practice server starts on its own, or the user knows the two lines that "
"start it."
msgstr ""
"Probni poslužitelj pokreće se sam, ili korisnik zna dva retka kojima ga "
"pokreće."

#: install.md:119
msgid ""
"`cadastral info` prints the screen above in a fresh terminal opened by the "
"user."
msgstr ""
"`uz info` ispisuje gornji zaslon u novom terminalu koji je korisnik otvorio."

#: install.md:120
msgid "`CADASTRAL_LANG` is set in the user's profile."
msgstr "`CADASTRAL_LANG` je postavljen u korisnikovu profilu."

#: install.md:121
msgid "The user has the link to [Start here](start-here.md) in their language."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik ima poveznicu na [Počnite ovdje](start-here.md) na svom jeziku."

#: install.md:122
msgid ""
"The user has your contact for when Terminal says the command is not found."
msgstr ""
"Korisnik ima vaš kontakt za slučaj da Terminal kaže da naredba nije "
"pronađena."

#: reference.md:9
msgid "Complete reference"
msgstr "Potpuni pregled naredbi"

#: reference.md:47
msgid "Other pages"
msgstr "Ostale stranice"

#: reference.md:49
msgid "[Start here](start-here.md): the tutorial."
msgstr "[Počnite ovdje](start-here.md): vodič za početak."

#: reference.md:50
msgid ""
"[Glossary](glossary.md): the words of the land registry and the cadastre."
msgstr "[Pojmovnik](glossary.md): riječi zemljišne knjige i katastra."

#: reference.md:51
msgid "[Errors](errors.md): what the messages mean."
msgstr "[Greške](errors.md): što znače poruke."

#: reference.md:52
msgid ""
"[Installation](install.md): for the technical colleague who sets the tool up."
msgstr "[Instalacija](install.md): za tehničkog kolegu koji postavlja alat."

#: start-here.md:9
msgid "Start here"
msgstr "Počnite ovdje"

#: start-here.md:11
msgid ""
"This tool lets you read the cadastre and the land registry from your own "
"computer, one typed line at a time. This page walks you through the five "
"things you will do most often. Each task ends with a link to the page that "
"explains the command in full."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj vam alat omogućuje da katastar i zemljišnu knjigu čitate s vlastitog "
"računala, jednom naredbom po upitu. Ova vas stranica vodi kroz pet stvari "
"koje ćete najčešće raditi. Svaki zadatak završava poveznicom na stranicu koja"
" naredbu objašnjava u cijelosti."

#: start-here.md:16
msgid "Before the first use"
msgstr "Prije prve uporabe"

#: start-here.md:18
msgid ""
"Ask a technical colleague to follow the [installation page](install.md). When"
" they are done, open Terminal and type the following line, then press Enter:"
msgstr ""
"Zamolite tehničkog kolegu da slijedi [stranicu o instalaciji](install.md). "
"Kad završi, otvorite Terminal, upišite sljedeći redak i pritisnite Enter:"

#: start-here.md:25
msgid ""
"If you see a table with a version number and no red text, you are ready. If "
"Terminal says the command is not found, go back to your colleague."
msgstr ""
"Ako vidite tablicu s brojem verzije i bez crvenog teksta, spremni ste. Ako "
"Terminal kaže da naredba nije pronađena, vratite se kolegi."

#: start-here.md:28
msgid ""
"Two things to know before you start. First, every command begins with the "
"word `cadastral`. Second, the tool works with practice data on your own "
"computer; nothing you type reaches the official registers."
msgstr ""
"Dvije stvari prije početka. Prvo, svaka naredba počinje riječju `uz`. Drugo, "
"alat radi s probnim podacima na vašem računalu; ništa što upišete ne stiže do"
" službenih registara."

#: start-here.md:32
msgid "Task 1: check who owns a parcel"
msgstr "Zadatak 1: provjerite tko je vlasnik čestice"

#: start-here.md:34
msgid "Find the parcel number and the cadastral municipality on your document."
msgstr "Pronađite broj čestice i katastarsku općinu na svom dokumentu."

#: start-here.md:41
msgid ""
"Read the table headed **OWNERSHIP SHEET (LIST B)**. Each row is one owner "
"with their share."
msgstr ""
"Pročitajte tablicu s naslovom **VLASTOVNICA (LIST B)**. Svaki redak jedan je "
"vlasnik s njegovim udjelom."

#: start-here.md:44 start-here.md:61
msgid "Full explanation: [get-lr-unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md)."
msgstr "Potpuno objašnjenje: [uložak](commands/get-lr-unit.md)."

#: start-here.md:46
msgid "Task 2: check for mortgages and other charges"
msgstr "Zadatak 2: provjerite hipoteke i druge terete"

#: start-here.md:48
msgid "Use the same parcel and municipality."
msgstr "Uzmite istu česticu i općinu."

#: start-here.md:55
msgid ""
"Read **ENCUMBRANCES SHEET (LIST C)**. If it says **No encumbrances found**, "
"list C is empty."
msgstr ""
"Pročitajte **TERETOVNICA (LIST C)**. Ako piše **Nema tereta**, list C je "
"prazan."

# fuzzy match of: Look for the line **Pending entries (plombe)** near the top.
# If it is there, a request is waiting to be entered and the sheets may
# change.
#: start-here.md:57
msgid ""
"Look for the line **Pending entries (plombe)** near the top. If it is there, "
"a request for registration (prijedlog) is waiting to be decided and the "
"sheets may change."
msgstr ""
"Potražite redak **Plombe (u tijeku)** pri vrhu. Ako ga ima, neki prijedlog za"
" upis čeka odluku i listovi se mogu promijeniti."

#: start-here.md:63
msgid "Task 3: look up many parcels at once"
msgstr "Zadatak 3: potražite više čestica odjednom"

#: start-here.md:65
msgid ""
"Write the parcel numbers in one line, separated by commas, inside quotes."
msgstr ""
"Napišite brojeve čestica u jednom retku, odvojene zarezima, unutar navodnika."

#: start-here.md:72
msgid ""
"Each row of the **RESULTS** table is one parcel. The **LR Unit** column is "
"the land registry unit of each."
msgstr ""
"Svaki redak tablice **REZULTATI** jedna je čestica. Stupac **ZK uložak** je "
"zemljišnoknjižni uložak svake od njih."

# fuzzy match of: Full explanation: [batch-fetch](commands/batch-fetch.md),
# and
# [batch-lr-unit](commands/batch-lr-unit.md) for reading all those units in
# one
# go.
#: start-here.md:75
msgid ""
"Full explanation: [get-parcel](commands/get-parcel.md), and [get-lr-"
"unit](commands/get-lr-unit.md) with `--input` for reading all those units in "
"one go."
msgstr ""
"Potpuno objašnjenje: [čestica](commands/get-parcel.md), a "
"[uložak](commands/get-lr-unit.md) uz `--ulaz` za uvid u sve te uloške "
"odjednom."

#: start-here.md:79
msgid "Task 4: save a result for a file or a colleague"
msgstr "Zadatak 4: spremite rezultat u datoteku ili za kolegu"

#: start-here.md:81
msgid "Take any command from this page."
msgstr "Uzmite bilo koju naredbu s ove stranice."

#: start-here.md:82
msgid "Add `--format json --output` and a file name at the end:"
msgstr "Na kraj dodajte `--oblik json --datoteka` i naziv datoteke:"

#: start-here.md:88
msgid ""
"The file appears in the folder Terminal is in, usually your home folder. "
"Attach it to the case file or send it on. `--format csv` gives a file that "
"opens in a spreadsheet instead."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka se pojavljuje u mapi u kojoj je Terminal, obično u vašoj osobnoj "
"mapi. Priložite je spisu ili proslijedite. `--oblik csv` umjesto toga daje "
"datoteku koja se otvara u programu za tablice."

#: start-here.md:92
msgid "Full explanation: the \"Choices you can make\" section of any command page."
msgstr ""
"Potpuno objašnjenje: odjeljak „Što možete odabrati” na stranici bilo koje "
"naredbe."

#: start-here.md:94
msgid "Task 5: see the parcel on a map"
msgstr "Zadatak 5: pogledajte česticu na karti"

#: start-here.md:102
msgid ""
"Near the bottom, under **ADDITIONAL INFO**, there is a **Map URL**. Copy it "
"into your web browser to see the parcel on the public map."
msgstr ""
"Pri dnu, pod **DODATNE INFORMACIJE**, nalazi se **URL karte**. Kopirajte ga u"
" svoj web preglednik da vidite česticu na javnoj karti."

#: start-here.md:105
msgid ""
"Full explanation: [get-parcel](commands/get-parcel.md), and [get-"
"geometry](commands/get-geometry.md) if you need the boundary for a mapping "
"program."
msgstr ""
"Potpuno objašnjenje: [čestica](commands/get-parcel.md), a "
"[granica](commands/get-geometry.md) ako trebate granicu za kartografski "
"program."

#: start-here.md:109
msgid "When something goes wrong"
msgstr "Kad nešto ne uspije"

#: start-here.md:111
msgid ""
"Every error starts with a red cross and a short message. The [errors "
"page](errors.md) lists them and says what to do. The most common cause is a "
"mistyped parcel number or municipality."
msgstr ""
"Svaka greška počinje crvenim križićem i kratkom porukom. [Stranica o "
"greškama](errors.md) ih ispisuje i kaže što učiniti. Najčešći je uzrok "
"pogrešno upisan broj čestice ili općine."

#: start-here.md:115
msgid "Where to go next"
msgstr "Kamo dalje"

#: start-here.md:117
msgid ""
"[Complete reference](reference.md): every command on one page, with links."
msgstr ""
"[Potpuni pregled naredbi](reference.md): sve naredbe na jednoj stranici, s "
"poveznicama."

#: start-here.md:118
msgid ""
"[Glossary](glossary.md): the words of the land registry and what the tool "
"calls them."
msgstr ""
"[Pojmovnik](glossary.md): riječi zemljišne knjige i kako ih alat naziva."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The first table, **LAND REGISTRY UNIT**, identifies the unit: its number, the"
#~ " main book, the office that keeps it, and **Last Diary Number**, the most "
#~ "recent file number entered in the diary (dnevnik). **PARCEL LIST (SHEET A)** "
#~ "is the posjedovnica, list A. **OWNERSHIP SHEET (LIST B)** is the vlastovnica,"
#~ " list B, with the share of each owner as a fraction. **ENCUMBRANCES SHEET "
#~ "(LIST C)** is the teretovnica, list C. When list C is empty, the tool prints "
#~ "**No encumbrances found**. When an entry is registered in favour of someone "
#~ "(its text ends with \"u korist:\"), the persons follow under **In favour "
#~ "of**, with their address and OIB when the registry has them."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Prva tablica, **ZEMLJIŠNOKNJIŽNI ULOŽAK**, određuje uložak: njegov broj, "
#~ "glavnu knjigu, ured koji ga vodi i **Zadnji broj dnevnika**, najnoviji "
#~ "poslovni broj upisan u dnevnik. **POSJEDOVNICA (LIST A)** je list A. "
#~ "**VLASTOVNICA (LIST B)** je list B, s udjelom svakog vlasnika kao razlomkom. "
#~ "**TERETOVNICA (LIST C)** je list C. Kada je list C prazan, alat ispisuje "
#~ "**Nema tereta**. Kada je upis uknjižen u nečiju korist (tekst mu završava s "
#~ "\"u korist:\"), osobe slijede pod **U korist**, s adresom i OIB-om kada ih "
#~ "zemljišna knjiga ima."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The cadastre does not hand out a possession sheet by its number, so this "
#~ "command stops at confirming the sheet. To see the possessors, look up one of "
#~ "the parcels that belongs to the sheet with [get-parcel](get-parcel.md) and "
#~ "`--show-owners`; the parcel numbers are on the extract."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Katastar ne izdaje posjedovni list po broju, pa ova naredba staje na potvrdi "
#~ "da list postoji. Posjednike vidite tako da jednu od čestica lista pogledate "
#~ "naredbom [get-parcel](get-parcel.md) uz `--show-owners`; brojevi čestica "
#~ "nalaze se na izvatku."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "| Posjedovni list | The possession sheet of the cadastre: who possesses a "
#~ "parcel according to the cadastre. Not proof of ownership. | [get-"
#~ "parcel](commands/get-parcel.md) with `--show-owners`. |"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "| Posjedovni list | Posjedovni list katastra: tko posjeduje česticu prema "
#~ "katastru. Nije dokaz vlasništva. | [čestica](commands/get-parcel.md) uz "
#~ "`--posjednici`. |"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`--format` chooses the form of the answer. `table` is what you see above. "
#~ "`json` gives the same data for other programs, including the plan identifier "
