#~ "owner as a fraction. **ENCUMBRANCES SHEET (LIST C)** is list C. When list C "
#~ "is empty, the tool prints **No encumbrances found**."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Prva tablica, **ZEMLJIŠNOKNJIŽNI ULOŽAK**, određuje uložak: njegov broj, "
